WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:25.640
'Mekkarai Village
Year 1979'

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.359
Hello!

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:47.279
Hey, Jones!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:48.439
Did you pick up the book I asked for?

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.159
Yes, I've got it set aside
for you, brother.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.479
It's raining really hard.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.999
Could you come and pick it up
tomorrow morning, brother?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.159
No, no. Um...

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.960
there's a four-day holiday
for Saraswathi Pooja, so...

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.999
I'll come over and pick it up then.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.240
- Alright?
- Okay, brother.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.439
What are you doing?

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.560
Come and get back to work!

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:32.559
We need to head home before
the rain gets any worse.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.320
Why don't we just open
this box and see what's inside?

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.240
Have you lost your mind?

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.239
Sir told us not to even go near that box.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:42.319
Don't you remember?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.399
We've been working here for six years.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.599
We know everything this shop has,

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.839
except for this box.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.999
If he's telling us not to touch it,

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.799
there must be something in there, right?

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.760
Hey, Vela! Listen to me.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.239
Come here.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.480
If sir said something,
there will be a reason for it.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:00.079
If you keep living in fear
just because sir said so,

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.399
we'll be stuck cleaning
dirty vessels forever.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.520
I've made up my mind.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.760
I have to know what's inside this.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.120
Vela... don't do it, Vela!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.520
I warn you, don't break it open!

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.120
Listen to me, Vela.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.600
What, man...

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:51.640
no matter how hard I hit it,

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.319
it just won't break.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.960
Something doesn't feel right.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.000
Don't break it!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.839
Hey! Don't run, Vela!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:39.640
Stop!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.280
Hey, Jones!

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.640
Where did he go?

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.680
Okay...

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.880
Pechi, open the door!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:54.640
Hey, Pechi!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:56.840
Coming!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.000
What happened, dear?

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.960
Why are you so late today? Hmm?

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.960
Of all days, I had to go to the
Othaipaalam Book Shop today,

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:12.320
and it just poured.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.200
That's why I got late.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:15.879
Alright.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:18.160
- Come on, I'll serve dinner.
- Dinner? Wait, wait.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.479
I had a feast at the manager's house,

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.680
I'm completely full.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.480
- Alright, let's go to sleep.
- Sleep?

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:26.159
I have exams coming up.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.599
I need to take some notes.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.839
You go ahead and lie down.
I'll come join you later, okay?

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.920
- Okay, but finish up soon, hmm?
- Alright.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.599
My name is Oliver Robert.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:25.760
I am a writer from France.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:29.279
My job is to travel around the world
in search of supernatural phenomena

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.960
and reveal to the world
what is happening there.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:36.880
Mekkarai was a village that hid such
a supernatural secret within itself.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.159
I opened my diary to write about

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:41.759
the supernatural events
happening in that village,

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.760
but something else happened.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:47.199
Opening the diary is all I remember.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.200
Yet, the diary was already written in...

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:52.639
even though I hadn't written anything.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.719
Moreover, what was written in that diary

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:57.399
was not about what had
happened in Mekkarai until then,

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:00.440
but about what was going
to happen in the days to come.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.039
If you have the courage beyond this point,

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.559
read this book further.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.519
Because for you, the reader of this book,

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.720
this might be your last day.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.679
- Hello.
- Sir, sir...

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.799
I am calling from the
Tirunelveli Central Library, sir.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.519
Sir, at 6:15 this morning,

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:20.679
our Chief Minister
is going to suffer a heart attack.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:22.120
Please, somehow save him!

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.200
Are you serious?

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:26.959
You people used to get drunk
and call the police station,

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.440
and now you've started
calling the CM's PA too?

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.359
If one more call comes from you,
I'm filing a police complaint, mind it.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.199
Cut the call!

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.200
Sir, sir, sir...

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.359
Hello.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.119
Please, sir, just listen
to what I have to say.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.359
Hey, don't you understand?
Cut the call!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.679
Sir, please just listen to this
one thing I have to say. I beg you.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:58.839
It's really important.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:10:59.799
Speak.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.720
One way or another, you're going
to look for me today morning.

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.920
My name is Manikam.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.120
Tirunelveli Central Library.

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:19.639
'For the upcoming
World Cup cricket series,'

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.959
'Venkata Raghavan has been selected
as the captain of the Indian team.'

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.159
'An important announcement.'

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:28.639
'Chief Minister Tamilvaanan, who had gone
to his hometown of Mekkarai for a vacation,'

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:31.559
'has been admitted to the hospital
due to a sudden heart attack.'

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.359
'As a result, his party supporters'

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.680
'are gathering in large numbers
in front of the hospital.'

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:53.280
How did you know about the CM's
heart attack before it even happened?

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.440
Will you speak when asked,

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.999
or will you only say it if you're
asked in a certain way?

00:11:59.000 --> 00:11:59.800
Hmm?

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:05.800
Read this, Alli.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.560
My name... how do you...

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.560
Read this,
and you will get all the answers.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:41.160
Eh... do you have
any other copies of this book?

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.960
Eh... yes, how much of this book
have you read so far?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.000
Until you...

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.880
become the Chief Minister.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.520
Does anyone else know about this?

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:58.640
Alright.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:05.199
Don't say a word to anyone outside
about this, or anything that happened here

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.439
If you as much as whisper about it,

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:08.919
you won't have breath left to live.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:09.960
Understand?

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.319
Hey?!

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.680
Why are you laughing now?

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.560
Hey!

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:25.360
It's Inspector Manjunathan who is
going to take me away from here, isn't it?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:27.960
Hmm?

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.239
Hey, tell me the truth!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.960
Just how much of this book have you read?

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:37.119
Page 74, line 13.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.000
By the order of Alli,

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:42.400
Manikam, a native of Mekkarai,

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:46.400
was burned to death
by Inspector Manjunathan!

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:58.600
'The Dark Heaven'

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:10.520
'28 years later'

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:16.640
'Kothagiri
Year 2014'

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:25.680
I came here to interview a madman,
now I'm the one going insane.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.000
It's been four days.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.360
All I've done is watch his house.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.760
He doesn't seem to be opening the door,

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.560
and she doesn't seem to be leaving either.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.120
Wait, I'll call you right back.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.280
What do you want?

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:10.200
I want to know about the Dark Heaven book.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:14.480
Why go knocking on Satan's door?

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.000
You look young.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.360
Forget everything and just leave.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.560
Just a minute!

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.600
What?

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.680
My father's name is Manikam.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.560
My hometown is Mekkarai.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:35.880
Now tell me.

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.640
Will you tell me about that book?

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:40.360
Or not?

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.320
Rex Rutherford.

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.560
One of India's greatest writers.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:58.799
Rex, the renowned writer, won the 'Sahitya
Akademi' award at such a young age.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:15:59.959
You were a young prodigy.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:04.159
Why did you just vanish after
talking about The Dark Heaven?

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.880
Even in this age of rapid
scientific advancement,

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.920
we still discuss Nostradamus's prophecies.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.600
There are many unbelievable stories here.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.080
Some people call them myths.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:21.760
Some of those stories...
are rooted in belief.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:29.520
And Mekkarai is a place that believes
in them with absolute conviction.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:35.880
'Mekkarai Village
Year 2007'

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:39.600
You've got your engagement today,
do you really need to work, Aaron?

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.679
It's 6:30 already.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.439
Don't be late for your own engagement

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.999
just because you're trying
to be on time for work.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.559
I'll make it on time.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:54.480
I'm just terrified of whether I'll even
make it through this month of June.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:55.999
Your heart is good, Aaron.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.799
Goddess Vanamangai
will surely be kind to you.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.440
Huh... I hope she does.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.400
- Aaron, check who that is.
- Huh?

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.519
Hmm.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:07.800
'Mekkarai Security Checkpost'

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.000
Who are you going to see inside?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.800
I'm Aaron, the constable, sir,
Mekkarai police station.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:27.719
Greetings, sir!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:29.280
I'm Senthil Kumar, the writer.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.800
Aaron, lift it!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.960
Why on earth did he come to this
place with his family this month?

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:54.159
- Blood pressure is slightly high.
- Huh.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:55.120
Don't worry.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.800
I'm writing down three tablets.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.400
Take them twice a day, morning and night.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.800
But you need to get some rest.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.000
You're telling a policeman
to take rest, doctor?

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:13.000
I need to be mentally strong to handle
what's about to unfold, doctor.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:18.800
The dreadful month of June,
which comes once every seven years,

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.480
begins today.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.560
Nothing's going to happen.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.759
Leave it to Goddess Vanamangai

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:34.160
and focus on the engagement.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.640
Hmm, sure, doctor.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.999
And... one more thing.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:40.920
Go on.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:44.120
I've been trying to borrow
money for Dharani's wedding.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.519
- It's getting a bit delayed.
- Hmm.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.399
If you know anyone who could get me a loan

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.440
at a low interest rate, could you help?

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:52.760
Hmm... I will arrange.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.320
Okay, doctor.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.560
Why the long face now?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.520
I'm talking to you.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.199
- When will uncle come, mom?
- He'll come soon.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.280
You're just lying to me.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.839
Don't get involved in grown- up problems.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.640
Just focus on your studies.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:13.800
Hmm.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:22.599
When you come here next time,
your uncle will definitely be here.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.760
- Now go and study well. Hmm?
- Hmm!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.399
Why does Dharani look so dull?

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.119
Hasn't she forgotten the past yet?

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.160
What happened to her
is not something easily forgotten.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.680
Don't worry, I'll take care of it.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:49.799
- Maragatham!
- Hmm?

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.239
The bike's having some trouble.

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.559
Eh... I'll drop it off at
Sandhanakili's shed,

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:56.160
then head over to the Big house for a bit.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:57.720
To the Big House?!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.840
Just a minute.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.240
Why are you going to the Big house now?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.320
A new Inspector has arrived.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.360
I'll go see him and be right back.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.800
Be safe.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:12.840
Hmm.

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.920
My dear Goddess Vanamangai...

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:25.160
This is a story we have grown up
hearing for generations.

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:30.239
Every time the month of June
approaches after those seven years,

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:34.640
the people of this village stand here,
having lost their peace for the entire year.

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:42.480
Have you decided that everyone
born as a human is a sinner, Mother?

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:43.920
Oh my dear Goddess...

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:48.280
at least with this generation,
please put an end to your vengeance.

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:16.400
We've picked the auspicious time for the
first day's ritual, between 9:00 and 10:30

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:43.160
Hand this over to the new Inspector.

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:36.680
Isn't Sandhanakili here?

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:42.079
He went to the station to
get some vehicle repaired, sir.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.680
He'll be back shortly.

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:45.640
Okay.

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:05.800
Hey, go get that jeep started.

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.399
Sir, how can I?

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.920
You're the mechanic here! Move!

00:24:19.880 --> 00:24:21.599
They're asking me to start a jeep
that hasn't run in seven years...

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:23.240
in just seven minutes.

00:24:29.720 --> 00:24:31.640
Sir, here are the keys.

00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:33.480
You can drive it now.

00:25:05.200 --> 00:25:06.960
Please move over a little.
You get on.

00:25:11.440 --> 00:25:12.520
Bye!

00:25:45.520 --> 00:25:48.800
Brother... Brother... Brother, wake up!

00:25:54.120 --> 00:25:55.319
Hey, what happened?

00:25:55.320 --> 00:25:56.320
Martin!

00:26:07.360 --> 00:26:08.720
- What's up, Azhagu?
- Sir!

00:26:08.920 --> 00:26:10.959
- Looks like the jeep is ready?
- Yes, sir.

00:26:10.960 --> 00:26:12.360
The new Inspector
is coming today, isn't he?

00:26:12.960 --> 00:26:13.960
Oh, yes.

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:16.400
- Where are you going?
- I'm going to the Big house, sir.

00:26:16.520 --> 00:26:17.520
Wait, I will also come.

00:26:18.560 --> 00:26:20.600
- What did you even fix on this jeep?
- Why, sir?

00:26:20.800 --> 00:26:22.720
It's still really hard to shift gears.

00:26:23.240 --> 00:26:24.240
I've got tons of wedding work.

00:26:24.400 --> 00:26:25.920
Fix it fast.

00:26:26.520 --> 00:26:28.760
Sir, you still owe me
4,300 rupees from before...

00:26:29.360 --> 00:26:30.480
Am I going anywhere?

00:26:30.760 --> 00:26:32.080
I'll pay you after the wedding.

00:26:32.240 --> 00:26:33.360
- Okay?
- Okay, sir.

00:26:50.640 --> 00:26:51.760
Welcome, son.

00:26:52.240 --> 00:26:55.359
My name is Naadukaathan.
I am the village headman here.

00:26:55.360 --> 00:26:58.120
We received the news
of your arrival a bit late.

00:26:58.280 --> 00:27:00.639
I have done my best
to clean the house for you.

00:27:00.640 --> 00:27:03.279
If there is anything wrong, let me know,
and I will send someone to help. Okay?

00:27:03.280 --> 00:27:05.319
Oh, sir, you have already done so much.

00:27:05.320 --> 00:27:06.320
I will manage the rest.

00:27:07.760 --> 00:27:09.520
And one more important thing.

00:27:09.760 --> 00:27:10.520
Tell me.

00:27:11.440 --> 00:27:15.640
Oh Mother Vanamangai!
You must be with us and protect us.

00:27:23.560 --> 00:27:24.480
No, sir.

00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:26.440
I don't believe in all this.

00:27:26.760 --> 00:27:29.160
Look, this village follows
certain customs.

00:27:29.280 --> 00:27:31.200
I am telling you this for
your own good, just accept it.

00:27:31.640 --> 00:27:32.600
No, I don't want it.

00:27:33.640 --> 00:27:36.479
Paari... he's saying it
for your own benefit.

00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:37.480
Just take it.

00:27:47.120 --> 00:27:50.159
This village isn't what you think it is.

00:27:50.160 --> 00:27:51.680
Go, place this in the prayer room.

00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:42.359
Look, look, look at that!

00:28:42.360 --> 00:28:43.960
Let's have a look at that
photo over there.

00:28:57.480 --> 00:28:58.280
Sir.

00:28:59.240 --> 00:28:59.960
Please come in.

00:29:00.960 --> 00:29:01.879
- Sir!
- Sir!

00:29:01.880 --> 00:29:04.599
Sir, I am Antony.
I am the SI at our station.

00:29:04.600 --> 00:29:06.520
Sir, I'm Azhagu, the constable.

00:29:07.160 --> 00:29:07.919
Please, sit down.

00:29:07.920 --> 00:29:09.800
- Would you like some tea or coffee?
- No, it's fine, sir. We're good.

00:29:10.320 --> 00:29:11.960
I have fixed my daughter's engagement.

00:29:12.400 --> 00:29:14.879
My son-in-law is also
a PC at our station, sir.

00:29:14.880 --> 00:29:16.639
I heard you were arriving.

00:29:16.640 --> 00:29:19.679
So, I thought I'd come by to
see you once... and invite you, sir.

00:29:19.680 --> 00:29:21.760
- Time?
- Around 11 a.m., sir.

00:29:22.280 --> 00:29:23.120
I will come.

00:29:23.280 --> 00:29:25.679
- Okay, sir...
- Sir, the jeep driver is on leave.

00:29:25.680 --> 00:29:27.400
If you want,
I can drive the jeep for you.

00:29:28.880 --> 00:29:30.799
No, I'll drive it myself.

00:29:30.800 --> 00:29:31.919
I'll call you if I need anything.

00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:32.880
Okay, sir.

00:29:33.200 --> 00:29:34.160
The key, sir.

00:29:34.960 --> 00:29:36.280
- I will also leave, sir.
- Hmm.

00:30:18.600 --> 00:30:27.440
"A hidden forest, dark and deep,
Waiting for a sacrifice to keep..."

00:30:28.240 --> 00:30:37.120
"A ghost is near to seal your fate,
And drag you to your funeral gate..."

00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:47.639
"Your heart will shake with sudden dread,
Death is coming for the dead..."

00:30:47.640 --> 00:30:57.359
"Run and hide, there's nowhere to go,
The demon comes with a thunder blow..."

00:30:57.360 --> 00:31:06.400
"A hidden forest, dark and deep,
Waiting for a sacrifice to keep..."

00:31:07.080 --> 00:31:15.680
"A ghost is near to seal your fate,
And drag you to your funeral gate..."

00:31:53.120 --> 00:31:56.440
Every engagement house I've visited
has been filled with happiness.

00:31:57.440 --> 00:31:59.560
But here, I don't see
a single person smiling.

00:32:02.320 --> 00:32:04.160
That's a long story, sir.

00:32:06.520 --> 00:32:07.439
A story?

00:32:07.440 --> 00:32:09.760
It's not a story of a year or two, sir.

00:32:10.920 --> 00:32:12.920
It's a story spanning
hundreds of years, sir.

00:32:14.160 --> 00:32:19.880
The people of Mekkarai lived happily,
doing agriculture in nature's embrace.

00:32:20.000 --> 00:32:21.199
Within this very village

00:32:21.200 --> 00:32:24.399
lived eighteen-year-old Vanamangai,
revered as a living goddess by the folk,

00:32:24.400 --> 00:32:27.560
alongside Dasarathan,
a master of ancient arts.

00:32:27.800 --> 00:32:29.519
One day, sensing
through her divine powers

00:32:29.520 --> 00:32:34.799
that Mekkarai was about
to suffer a massive famine,

00:32:34.800 --> 00:32:36.519
Vanamangai decided to save the village.

00:32:36.520 --> 00:32:38.239
Without telling anyone,

00:32:38.240 --> 00:32:39.959
she left the mountain, went down,

00:32:39.960 --> 00:32:42.799
and immersed herself in intense
penance at the Shiva temple.

00:32:42.800 --> 00:32:45.559
The people of the village searched
high and low for Vanamangai,

00:32:45.560 --> 00:32:47.679
but she was nowhere to be found.

00:32:47.680 --> 00:32:49.159
Years passed.

00:32:49.160 --> 00:32:50.719
Just as Vanamangai had dreaded,

00:32:50.720 --> 00:32:53.799
a severe drought struck Mekkarai,
robbing them of rain and harvest,

00:32:53.800 --> 00:32:55.279
plunging them into utter famine.

00:32:55.280 --> 00:33:01.119
Believing that Vanamangai leaving
the village was the reason for the famine,

00:33:01.120 --> 00:33:03.319
the villagers decided to leave
the village of Mekkarai.

00:33:03.320 --> 00:33:05.199
At that moment, Dasarathan
stepped forward and said,

00:33:05.200 --> 00:33:07.519
"Do not leave the mountains.

00:33:07.520 --> 00:33:08.359
Just wait 21 days.

00:33:08.360 --> 00:33:09.279
I will fast for the Goddess

00:33:09.280 --> 00:33:12.839
and bring the rains back to this village."

00:33:12.840 --> 00:33:14.559
The villagers agreed.

00:33:14.560 --> 00:33:15.759
The 21st day arrived.

00:33:15.760 --> 00:33:19.079
The villagers kept their eyes on the sky,
hoping for rain.

00:33:19.080 --> 00:33:20.679
Suddenly, to everyone's surprise,
after seven long years,

00:33:20.680 --> 00:33:22.239
Vanamangai returned to the village.

00:33:22.240 --> 00:33:24.319
And with her, the rain began to pour.

00:33:24.320 --> 00:33:27.919
Believing that rain came back only
because Vanamangai returned,

00:33:27.920 --> 00:33:31.439
the villagers praised and celebrated her.

00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:35.239
Dasarathan was absolutely furious that
all the honor and respect meant for him

00:33:35.240 --> 00:33:38.279
went straight to Vanamangai instead.

00:33:38.280 --> 00:33:39.919
Dasarathan teamed up with his aunt
Kovazhagi and cooked up a wicked plan.

00:33:39.920 --> 00:33:42.639
That same night, he met the village head

00:33:42.640 --> 00:33:45.719
and claimed the rain was actually
because of his ritual,

00:33:45.720 --> 00:33:49.559
and that Vanamangai is pregnant
without even getting married.

00:33:49.560 --> 00:33:51.839
Hearing this, the village head was
shocked and refused to believe it.

00:33:51.840 --> 00:33:53.919
But Dasarathan swore it
was the absolute truth,

00:33:53.920 --> 00:33:56.279
warning him that if that unholy child
survived to see the sunrise tomorrow,

00:33:56.280 --> 00:33:59.119
it would spell total destruction
for the village with no turning back.

00:33:59.120 --> 00:34:01.599
After that, the village head
sent the medicine lady Kovazhagi

00:34:01.600 --> 00:34:04.959
to check Vanamangai's pulse
and see if she was pregnant.

00:34:04.960 --> 00:34:08.759
She checked the pulse and came back,
lying that Vanamangai was pregnant.

00:34:08.760 --> 00:34:11.159
Hearing that, the village head was
utterly shocked and shattered.

00:34:11.160 --> 00:34:13.079
When the village head asked
what needed to be done,

00:34:13.080 --> 00:34:19.399
Dasarathan replied,
"Burning that demon is the only way."

00:34:19.400 --> 00:34:21.639
While Vanamangai was sleeping at home,

00:34:21.640 --> 00:34:23.999
Dasarathan, with the
help of the villagers,

00:34:24.000 --> 00:34:25.559
set fire to Vanamangai's house.

00:34:25.560 --> 00:34:27.319
The fire caught and blazed.

00:34:27.320 --> 00:34:31.599
Vanamangai screamed for help,
but no one came.

00:34:31.600 --> 00:34:33.079
When Dasarathan told her what happened,

00:34:33.080 --> 00:34:34.519
Vanamangai was filled with great anger.

00:34:34.520 --> 00:34:37.399
'This village doubted the very girl
who lived and breathed for them!

00:34:37.400 --> 00:34:39.239
Now, as I die in these flames,
I leave you with a curse!

00:34:39.240 --> 00:34:43.479
For every seven years, the sixth month
which falls once every year,

00:34:43.480 --> 00:34:46.199
men in this village will meet
a brutal, horrific death!'

00:34:46.200 --> 00:34:48.279
Shouting this,
she let the fire consume her.

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:49.479
In that same month,

00:34:49.480 --> 00:34:51.399
that Dasarathan was found
mysteriously dead,

00:34:51.400 --> 00:34:53.920
in his vomit pool of blood
on that red sand road.

00:34:54.120 --> 00:34:57.639
In the days that followed,
the village head and other men in town

00:34:57.640 --> 00:35:00.279
started dropping dead
under mysterious circumstances.

00:35:00.280 --> 00:35:02.119
Everyone started believing

00:35:02.120 --> 00:35:04.359
that the curse cast by Vanamangai
was the reason for all this.

00:35:04.360 --> 00:35:06.479
Because of this,
all the villagers gathered

00:35:06.480 --> 00:35:08.319
to appease her anger,

00:35:08.320 --> 00:35:11.520
they built a temple for Vanamangai
and started worshipping her.

00:35:11.640 --> 00:35:13.560
Despite their prayers and devotion,

00:35:13.680 --> 00:35:16.679
while the number of men dying decreased,

00:35:16.680 --> 00:35:18.119
the mysterious deaths never truly stopped.

00:35:18.120 --> 00:35:19.799
The villagers completely
ostracized Dasarathan's kin,

00:35:19.800 --> 00:35:20.999
cutting all ties with his family.

00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:23.479
As time passed,
among Dasarathan's family line,

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:27.919
only Kani was left alive
as the last person.

00:35:27.920 --> 00:35:33.359
Martin Sir loved Kani with all his heart.

00:35:33.360 --> 00:35:35.479
He considered Kani his entire world
and was determined to marry her.

00:35:35.480 --> 00:35:37.959
Neither the villagers

00:35:37.960 --> 00:35:40.959
nor Father Christopher, who had
raised him, accepted his decision.

00:35:40.960 --> 00:35:45.479
Undeterred by their opposition,
Martin Sir decided to marry Kani

00:35:45.480 --> 00:35:47.239
and leave the village forever.

00:35:47.240 --> 00:35:50.719
Kani and Martin Sir began
their life together in happiness.

00:35:50.720 --> 00:35:52.839
But fate has a way of
catching up to everyone.

00:35:52.840 --> 00:35:56.039
Martin Sir received a posting
as an Inspector in Mekkarai,

00:35:56.040 --> 00:35:58.360
and he moved into that grand, Big house.

00:35:58.880 --> 00:36:00.640
I am married to you now,

00:36:02.240 --> 00:36:04.639
so the curse of Dasarathan's lineage
shouldn't touch me anymore, right?

00:36:04.640 --> 00:36:06.640
Will you take me to see the Goddess?

00:36:07.480 --> 00:36:09.319
Even if the entire village
stands against us,

00:36:09.320 --> 00:36:11.480
I will take you to
Vanamangai's temple myself.

00:36:12.120 --> 00:36:14.919
Driven by Kani's desire to
pay her respects to Vanamangai,

00:36:14.920 --> 00:36:17.719
Martin sir drove her
to the temple in his jeep.

00:36:17.720 --> 00:36:20.799
As Kani stood in awe,
gazing at the idol of Vanamangai,

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:22.519
a sudden, piercing scream
shattered the silence.

00:36:22.520 --> 00:36:24.279
Kani rushed to see what had happened,

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:26.399
only to find Martin sir lifeless
in the driver's seat of the jeep.

00:36:26.400 --> 00:36:31.159
The villagers began to blame
Kani for Martin's death.

00:36:31.160 --> 00:36:32.999
Seven years have passed since that day,

00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:35.600
and today is the first time
we are finally moving that jeep.

00:36:38.160 --> 00:36:39.120
Sir, here's your tea.

00:36:39.480 --> 00:36:40.200
Oh!

00:36:40.920 --> 00:36:43.199
So, is this why no other inspector
is willing to come to this village?

00:36:43.200 --> 00:36:44.200
Yes, sir.

00:36:48.200 --> 00:36:49.359
- Hey, Azhagu!
- Yes, sir?

00:36:49.360 --> 00:36:50.360
Don't you get milk tea here?

00:36:50.800 --> 00:36:52.679
With all this rain and the constant chill,

00:36:52.680 --> 00:36:54.840
everyone in this village
sticks to black tea, sir.

00:36:59.920 --> 00:37:02.200
The moment Paari
learned about that village,

00:37:02.920 --> 00:37:04.480
he couldn't have imagined

00:37:04.960 --> 00:37:07.440
that the remaining days of that June

00:37:08.160 --> 00:37:10.880
would leave his
entire life scarred forever.

00:37:14.120 --> 00:37:15.880
'Thenmala
Kerala'

00:37:18.360 --> 00:37:19.119
Hey!

00:37:19.120 --> 00:37:20.479
You're going there tomorrow anyway.

00:37:20.480 --> 00:37:21.799
Let's just talk in person then.

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:23.359
The time for the last bus is almost here.

00:37:23.360 --> 00:37:25.200
Come on, go take a bath and
get ready, and you'll be just in time.

00:37:27.880 --> 00:37:28.840
Alright, fine then.

00:37:28.960 --> 00:37:29.960
Let's meet tomorrow.

00:37:41.120 --> 00:37:42.120
Be safe.

00:37:42.320 --> 00:37:43.600
I'll take care of it, Bhai.

00:38:19.000 --> 00:38:20.319
The bus has arrived

00:38:20.320 --> 00:38:20.960
Stay on the line

00:38:51.760 --> 00:38:53.080
When did he call you?

00:38:53.920 --> 00:38:55.760
It must be around 6.15.

00:38:56.560 --> 00:38:59.200
Is there any way to leave the village
other than through the check post?

00:38:59.760 --> 00:39:02.200
There is, sir.
There's a red sand trail.

00:39:04.560 --> 00:39:06.760
But nobody uses it these days, sir.

00:39:07.640 --> 00:39:08.360
Why?

00:39:08.920 --> 00:39:11.159
The villagers say that
Dasarathan's spirit wanders there,

00:39:11.160 --> 00:39:16.640
and on top of that, they claim you can
hear a man weeping there every Friday, sir

00:39:28.720 --> 00:39:29.480
Greetings, sir.

00:39:32.000 --> 00:39:32.920
Sit down.

00:39:35.840 --> 00:39:37.879
What you're about to
tell me is very sensitive.

00:39:37.880 --> 00:39:38.640
Okay, sir.

00:39:38.760 --> 00:39:41.519
So, tell me clearly exactly what you saw.

00:39:41.520 --> 00:39:45.199
I went out to milk the cows at 4:15 this
morning when I heard the sound of a violin

00:39:45.200 --> 00:39:46.399
I couldn't tell who it was.

00:39:46.400 --> 00:39:48.519
When I looked at the corner of the street,
I saw a tall figure standing there.

00:39:48.520 --> 00:39:50.559
I asked who it was,
but there was no reply.

00:39:50.560 --> 00:39:52.639
So, I just headed back home
for my usual coffee.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:55.960
Later, the radio news mentioned that
a psycho killer from Kerala had escaped,

00:39:56.200 --> 00:40:00.200
and the description they gave
matched the figure I had seen.

00:40:02.400 --> 00:40:03.599
Have you told this to anyone else?

00:40:03.600 --> 00:40:04.840
I haven't told a soul, sir.

00:40:05.720 --> 00:40:06.440
Alright.

00:40:06.600 --> 00:40:08.399
Don't tell anyone else
what you just told me.

00:40:08.400 --> 00:40:09.119
Understood, sir.

00:40:09.120 --> 00:40:10.279
- We'll take care of this.
- Okay, sir.

00:40:10.280 --> 00:40:12.000
- You may go now.
- I'll leave, sir.

00:40:20.640 --> 00:40:22.159
Attention everyone!

00:40:22.160 --> 00:40:24.119
Inspector of Mekkarai
has put out an urgent warning

00:40:24.120 --> 00:40:26.319
that a masked psycho
from Kerala has escaped

00:40:26.320 --> 00:40:28.719
and is roaming around this very area!

00:40:28.720 --> 00:40:32.319
So if you spot anyone new
carrying a violin or wearing a mask,

00:40:32.320 --> 00:40:34.120
report it to the police immediately!

00:40:35.760 --> 00:40:37.360
The case that started in Kerala

00:40:37.880 --> 00:40:39.200
reached Mekkarai.

00:40:39.520 --> 00:40:40.680
And it...

00:40:41.680 --> 00:40:43.000
reached Paari's hands.

00:40:48.480 --> 00:40:49.200
Her name?

00:40:49.560 --> 00:40:50.440
Jessica, sir.

00:40:50.680 --> 00:40:51.759
What are you to this girl?

00:40:51.760 --> 00:40:52.919
I am her guardian.

00:40:52.920 --> 00:40:54.400
She is growing up in our home, sir.

00:40:54.600 --> 00:40:56.000
Does the girl have any love interests?

00:40:56.480 --> 00:40:57.920
As far as I know,
there isn't anything like that, sir.

00:40:58.320 --> 00:40:59.760
But it could be going on
without your knowledge, right?

00:40:59.920 --> 00:41:02.400
Sir... she's such a good girl.

00:41:06.760 --> 00:41:07.959
How long has the girl been missing?

00:41:07.960 --> 00:41:09.720
Mary said she's been gone
since 6:00 PM, sir.

00:41:11.760 --> 00:41:13.600
- And who is Mary?
- She's Jessica's roommate.

00:41:13.720 --> 00:41:15.320
She also grows up in our home.

00:41:42.200 --> 00:41:43.800
You and Jessica are roommates, right?

00:41:44.080 --> 00:41:45.760
Hmm. Yes, sir.

00:41:46.080 --> 00:41:47.479
What time did you see her going out?

00:41:47.480 --> 00:41:50.360
Around... 6:00 PM, sir.

00:41:50.720 --> 00:41:53.120
Does she often go out and
come back late like this?

00:41:53.320 --> 00:41:54.519
Not at all, sir.

00:41:54.520 --> 00:41:57.480
Whenever she goes out,
she's always back home by 8:00.

00:41:57.680 --> 00:41:59.720
What time did you tell the
Father that Jessica was missing?

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:03.480
Around... 11:15, sir.

00:42:04.160 --> 00:42:06.760
Jessica never stays out past 8:00,

00:42:07.280 --> 00:42:09.000
and here it is past 11:00.

00:42:09.520 --> 00:42:11.000
Her phone is off, too.

00:42:11.520 --> 00:42:13.960
Yet, you waited three hours
to tell the Father, why?

00:42:15.320 --> 00:42:16.080
Mary!

00:42:16.320 --> 00:42:16.919
Huh?

00:42:16.920 --> 00:42:18.960
I can only help you if you
start telling me the truth.

00:42:24.600 --> 00:42:28.720
They... they were really in love, sir.
Joseph and Jessica.

00:42:30.720 --> 00:42:33.800
But Kani sister wouldn't agree
to their marriage at all.

00:42:36.560 --> 00:42:38.159
I need to talk to you about
something important.

00:42:38.160 --> 00:42:38.960
Go ahead, sister-in-law.

00:42:39.240 --> 00:42:40.920
The Father came by our house.

00:42:43.440 --> 00:42:44.360
What did he say?

00:42:44.760 --> 00:42:46.960
Joseph, that girl Jessica is not for you.

00:42:47.080 --> 00:42:48.999
You and my brother had
a love marriage, didn't you?

00:42:49.000 --> 00:42:50.560
Why are you telling us
we can't do the same?

00:42:51.360 --> 00:42:52.800
She's the only one I want.

00:42:52.960 --> 00:42:54.160
I'm only going to marry her.

00:42:55.640 --> 00:42:59.280
Joseph and Kani have been fighting
about this constantly ever since.

00:42:59.480 --> 00:43:01.400
Not everyone gets what they want in life.

00:43:02.000 --> 00:43:05.200
And even if they do...
there's no guarantee it will last.

00:43:06.000 --> 00:43:07.160
Just listen to me.

00:43:09.640 --> 00:43:12.399
You're not my mother,
so don't tell me who I can or can't marry.

00:43:12.400 --> 00:43:13.400
You're just my sister-in-law.

00:43:15.800 --> 00:43:19.120
After that,
Joseph brother left his home, sir.

00:43:20.440 --> 00:43:22.399
He called her yesterday.

00:43:22.400 --> 00:43:24.200
Meet me at the bus stand
tomorrow at 10 AM.

00:43:24.360 --> 00:43:25.199
I'll be there too.

00:43:25.200 --> 00:43:26.480
We'll get married

00:43:27.080 --> 00:43:28.400
and start a new life together!

00:43:29.120 --> 00:43:29.920
Marriage?

00:43:31.160 --> 00:43:32.119
I don't get it.

00:43:32.120 --> 00:43:33.199
There's nothing like that, sir.

00:43:33.200 --> 00:43:34.840
- She's just babbling nonsense.
- Hmm!

00:43:37.680 --> 00:43:38.560
Go on.

00:43:39.160 --> 00:43:41.279
Jessica left, went to the bus stand,

00:43:41.280 --> 00:43:42.960
and waited there for a long time.

00:43:44.520 --> 00:43:46.560
But Joseph never showed up.

00:43:46.920 --> 00:43:48.920
She tried calling him,
but his phone was switched off.

00:43:49.600 --> 00:43:52.480
We even went to his house
and asked Kani sister.

00:43:52.600 --> 00:43:54.560
She said he never came there.

00:43:55.200 --> 00:43:58.640
We came back to our room,
and Jessica just kept crying, sir.

00:43:58.880 --> 00:44:02.320
Then, around... 6:00 PM,

00:44:02.600 --> 00:44:04.960
she said she was going to the shop
to buy sanitary pads.

00:44:05.640 --> 00:44:08.000
She left... and she never came back.

00:44:09.680 --> 00:44:12.320
Father, why did you hide the fact that
Jessica was in love with someone from me?

00:44:12.480 --> 00:44:13.320
Sir...

00:44:13.800 --> 00:44:16.000
I've already lost Martin.

00:44:16.760 --> 00:44:21.600
I didn't want Jessica to get married
into Dasarathan's family again, sir.

00:44:21.920 --> 00:44:24.480
I had already found a good match for her.

00:44:25.000 --> 00:44:27.440
That's exactly why I didn't want
any of this to get out.

00:44:28.640 --> 00:44:29.640
What's your name?

00:44:31.920 --> 00:44:32.840
He's Peter, sir.

00:44:33.080 --> 00:44:34.080
What do you do?

00:44:34.960 --> 00:44:37.200
He takes care of all the
odd jobs around the church, sir.

00:44:38.760 --> 00:44:40.080
Won't he tell me that himself?

00:44:48.000 --> 00:44:49.560
We'll meet again, Father.

00:44:50.320 --> 00:44:51.000
Hmm.

00:45:02.720 --> 00:45:03.800
What happened, sir?

00:45:05.320 --> 00:45:07.880
This girl, Mary,
is hiding something, Azhagu.

00:45:08.880 --> 00:45:10.199
Something feels wrong.

00:45:10.200 --> 00:45:11.600
What makes you say that, sir?

00:45:17.840 --> 00:45:19.960
I can see so much fear in her eyes.

00:45:21.200 --> 00:45:22.880
The guy Jessica was in love with...

00:45:23.320 --> 00:45:24.639
his name is...

00:45:24.640 --> 00:45:26.840
It's Joseph, sir!
He's our Martin sir's younger brother.

00:45:26.960 --> 00:45:28.200
Where is his house?

00:45:28.480 --> 00:45:29.640
It's nearby, sir.

00:45:30.560 --> 00:45:31.480
Come, let's go.

00:46:06.880 --> 00:46:07.959
Are you Kani?

00:46:07.960 --> 00:46:08.680
Yes.

00:46:09.360 --> 00:46:10.160
Hmm!

00:46:14.920 --> 00:46:16.000
What happened, sir?

00:46:16.280 --> 00:46:17.520
How is Joseph related to you?

00:46:17.720 --> 00:46:18.920
He's my brother-in-law.

00:46:19.160 --> 00:46:20.560
Do you know Jessica?

00:46:21.440 --> 00:46:22.200
Yes, I know her.

00:46:22.680 --> 00:46:25.279
Joseph and Jessica were planning
to get married today.

00:46:25.280 --> 00:46:26.400
Do you know about that?

00:46:28.520 --> 00:46:30.439
- I don't know, sir.
- Sir, I've checked.

00:46:30.440 --> 00:46:31.520
There's no one inside.

00:46:32.280 --> 00:46:34.560
Sir, who are you looking for?

00:46:34.840 --> 00:46:35.840
Joseph.

00:46:36.880 --> 00:46:38.600
He hasn't been here in six months.

00:46:39.000 --> 00:46:40.720
He doesn't even talk to me anymore.

00:46:41.080 --> 00:46:42.440
Why did you stop speaking?

00:46:46.560 --> 00:46:47.640
I'm asking you!

00:46:47.960 --> 00:46:49.400
He loved Jessica.

00:46:49.760 --> 00:46:51.440
He was set on marrying her.

00:46:51.720 --> 00:46:53.000
I told him no.

00:46:53.200 --> 00:46:55.240
That day, he threw his plate
and walked out.

00:46:55.400 --> 00:46:56.639
It's been six months.

00:46:56.640 --> 00:46:58.200
He hasn't even come near this house since.

00:46:58.760 --> 00:47:01.320
Why did you forbid Joseph
from marrying Jessica?

00:47:04.200 --> 00:47:06.799
The way Jessica and Joseph are carrying on
is completely unacceptable, dear.

00:47:06.800 --> 00:47:07.800
What happened?

00:47:08.440 --> 00:47:10.520
I think they both are in love
with each other.

00:47:11.240 --> 00:47:12.720
That's a good thing, Father.

00:47:13.240 --> 00:47:14.640
Jessica is a very good girl.

00:47:14.840 --> 00:47:16.600
I have no objection
to this at all, Father.

00:47:17.480 --> 00:47:20.320
You may be okay with it, but...

00:47:21.320 --> 00:47:22.320
But what?

00:47:22.720 --> 00:47:26.000
I already lost a soul to the
Dasarathan family once.

00:47:26.320 --> 00:47:30.240
I don't have the heart to watch
Jessica end up where you are today.

00:47:30.400 --> 00:47:31.400
And that's not all.

00:47:32.000 --> 00:47:34.000
- By breaking the rules of our village...
- That's enough, Father.

00:47:34.360 --> 00:47:35.240
I understand.

00:47:35.400 --> 00:47:37.480
Joseph won't speak to Jessica again.

00:47:38.800 --> 00:47:40.080
That's exactly why I told him that.

00:47:42.000 --> 00:47:43.000
Okay.

00:47:44.120 --> 00:47:46.280
If either Jessica or Joseph
shows up in person

00:47:46.520 --> 00:47:47.839
or calls,

00:47:47.840 --> 00:47:49.480
inform the station immediately.

00:47:50.640 --> 00:47:52.000
He won't come here.

00:47:54.280 --> 00:47:55.800
But if he does,
you'll let me know, won't you?

00:48:07.000 --> 00:48:08.320
- Azhagu.
- Sir?

00:48:08.520 --> 00:48:10.080
Is Kani alone in that house?

00:48:10.440 --> 00:48:11.320
No, sir.

00:48:12.240 --> 00:48:14.880
Kani and her daughter Anna are there, sir.

00:48:15.320 --> 00:48:17.760
I think Anna stays in a hostel
for her studies, sir.

00:48:19.480 --> 00:48:20.920
How old is that girl?

00:48:22.560 --> 00:48:24.000
She should be about 7 years old, sir.

00:48:25.760 --> 00:48:27.840
Why does she need to stay
in a hostel at this age?

00:48:28.840 --> 00:48:29.840
I don't know, sir.

00:48:30.760 --> 00:48:32.399
Maybe she just doesn't want her daughter

00:48:32.400 --> 00:48:34.600
to go through the hardships
she had to face.

00:48:43.840 --> 00:48:45.280
- I'll see you in the morning.
- Okay, sir.

00:49:04.680 --> 00:49:06.519
Paari sir, it's Mary.

00:49:06.520 --> 00:49:09.759
I need to tell you something
important about Jessica in person.

00:49:09.760 --> 00:49:11.599
I'll come to the station tomorrow morning.

00:49:11.600 --> 00:49:13.160
Hey Mary, this is Azhagu.

00:49:13.400 --> 00:49:15.720
Paari sir left his phone in the jeep.

00:49:16.160 --> 00:49:17.960
- I'll let him know.
- Okay, brother.

00:49:24.360 --> 00:49:27.800
I've only seen these kinds of
'psycho' stories in movies.

00:49:30.680 --> 00:49:34.600
Is there any way you can catch him
before he strikes again?

00:49:38.000 --> 00:49:39.000
What happened?

00:49:39.120 --> 00:49:39.760
Hmm?

00:49:41.840 --> 00:49:42.840
It's just...

00:49:44.280 --> 00:49:47.480
Joseph came from Kerala
to see Jessica, and now he's gone.

00:49:48.000 --> 00:49:50.720
Jessica was waiting for him,
and now she's missing too.

00:49:50.960 --> 00:49:52.320
What if...

00:49:52.720 --> 00:49:55.399
what if that psycho killer
did something to them?

00:49:55.400 --> 00:49:58.000
No, no. Nothing like that
could have happened.

00:49:59.120 --> 00:50:01.960
Just stop thinking about it for now
and have your dinner.

00:50:03.920 --> 00:50:04.720
Sir.

00:50:05.400 --> 00:50:06.120
Hmm?

00:50:09.640 --> 00:50:12.120
Sir, you left your phone in the jeep.

00:50:12.640 --> 00:50:14.000
Mary called.

00:50:14.200 --> 00:50:16.800
She said it's something important and that
she'll come to the station in the morning.

00:50:16.920 --> 00:50:18.320
We just saw her a little while ago.

00:50:21.280 --> 00:50:23.560
- Go ahead, we'll talk in the morning.
- Okay, sir.

00:51:12.720 --> 00:51:13.840
Who is it?

00:51:32.920 --> 00:51:33.640
Sir.

00:51:33.880 --> 00:51:35.799
It happened around 1:00 AM, sir.

00:51:35.800 --> 00:51:38.959
He locked the Father's room from outside
and dragged Mary out of the church.

00:51:38.960 --> 00:51:39.759
Forensics?

00:51:39.760 --> 00:51:41.720
They're inside collecting
fingerprints as we speak, sir.

00:52:19.440 --> 00:52:20.960
Tell me exactly what happened.

00:52:23.360 --> 00:52:25.080
It was around 1:00 AM.

00:52:26.160 --> 00:52:28.080
Suddenly, I heard a violin playing.

00:52:28.760 --> 00:52:32.240
It was... unsettling, sir.

00:52:33.640 --> 00:52:35.480
The power was out too.

00:52:35.960 --> 00:52:38.880
I grabbed a torch to check it out,

00:52:40.960 --> 00:52:42.280
- and then...
- And then?

00:52:45.520 --> 00:52:46.840
I saw him, sir.

00:52:52.480 --> 00:52:53.800
It was Satan, sir.

00:52:54.800 --> 00:52:56.520
He... he was Satan himself, sir.

00:52:57.400 --> 00:52:59.400
I was so terrified
I didn't know what to do,

00:52:59.880 --> 00:53:02.680
so I ran and locked myself in my room.

00:53:05.960 --> 00:53:08.360
I... I don't know
what happened after that, sir.

00:53:08.920 --> 00:53:10.720
Peter only woke me up in the morning.

00:53:12.440 --> 00:53:14.800
When I came to question Mary last night,

00:53:15.360 --> 00:53:16.640
Peter was here, wasn't he?

00:53:17.000 --> 00:53:17.760
Yes.

00:53:19.000 --> 00:53:20.920
If he only woke you up in the morning,

00:53:22.160 --> 00:53:23.760
where was Peter last night?

00:53:25.760 --> 00:53:27.120
Answer me, Father.

00:53:27.600 --> 00:53:32.400
I sent him to look for Jessica
down the hill.

00:53:32.840 --> 00:53:35.400
How did you know for sure
she'd left the hill?

00:53:37.280 --> 00:53:40.520
If you had already come down the hill,
why did you go back up immediately?

00:53:40.880 --> 00:53:42.519
The jeep broke down on the way.

00:53:42.520 --> 00:53:46.880
Sandhanakili helped tow it
and dropped me off here.

00:53:47.120 --> 00:53:48.760
- Azhagu?
- I checked, sir.

00:53:48.880 --> 00:53:50.999
Peter had gone down the hill at 12:30 AM.

00:53:51.000 --> 00:53:53.440
Sandhanakili too went down at 4:00 AM.

00:53:55.000 --> 00:53:56.999
Sir, Mani hasn't stopped anywhere.

00:53:57.000 --> 00:53:58.599
He didn't pick up any scents,

00:53:58.600 --> 00:54:00.640
and he absolutely didn't show
any indication of anything.

00:54:12.440 --> 00:54:14.400
Hmm, you can go now.

00:54:17.160 --> 00:54:17.920
Father.

00:54:18.680 --> 00:54:22.519
Neither you nor Peter are to leave
the church without permission.

00:54:22.520 --> 00:54:24.159
I'm telling you this for your own good.

00:54:24.160 --> 00:54:24.880
Hmm.

00:54:27.680 --> 00:54:28.760
- Azhagu!
- Yes, sir?

00:54:28.880 --> 00:54:31.239
Announce throughout the village,
no one is to step outside after 6:00 PM.

00:54:31.240 --> 00:54:31.839
Okay, sir.

00:54:31.840 --> 00:54:33.919
Tell them to call the police
immediately if they hear a violin.

00:54:33.920 --> 00:54:34.479
Okay, sir.

00:54:34.480 --> 00:54:37.319
Put all our PCs on patrol.
Only two need to stay at the station.

00:54:37.320 --> 00:54:39.640
Sir... has that serial killer
already entered the village?

00:54:41.640 --> 00:54:42.640
Maybe.

00:54:45.280 --> 00:54:47.280
But there's one thing I don't understand.

00:54:49.840 --> 00:54:52.240
The Father complained
that Jessica was missing.

00:54:52.920 --> 00:54:54.120
When we investigated,

00:54:54.760 --> 00:54:56.960
Mary told us that Jessica
and Joseph were in love,

00:54:57.720 --> 00:55:00.320
and they planned to get married today.

00:55:02.160 --> 00:55:04.559
A little later, Mary called me

00:55:04.560 --> 00:55:07.000
and said she had something
important to tell me.

00:55:07.920 --> 00:55:10.200
And moments later, Mary went missing.

00:55:12.840 --> 00:55:15.760
Joseph is the only name
connecting everything.

00:55:16.960 --> 00:55:18.640
But no one knows where he is.

00:55:19.920 --> 00:55:22.120
Only once we find Joseph

00:55:23.160 --> 00:55:24.760
will we know if this
is a planned kidnapping

00:55:25.280 --> 00:55:27.800
or the work of a serial killer.

00:55:29.800 --> 00:55:30.920
- Azhagu.
- Sir?

00:55:31.640 --> 00:55:34.400
Get all the details
about this serial killer

00:55:34.720 --> 00:55:36.599
from the Kerala police immediately.

00:55:36.600 --> 00:55:37.600
Okay, sir.

00:55:37.920 --> 00:55:39.440
I'm going to look for Joseph.

00:55:40.480 --> 00:55:42.840
The place where this case
really begins isn't Mekkarai...

00:55:44.680 --> 00:55:45.680
it's Thenmalai!

00:55:55.600 --> 00:55:57.679
As if the troubles we've had
this June weren't enough,

00:55:57.680 --> 00:55:59.800
now we have this psycho killer.

00:56:00.760 --> 00:56:02.359
I wonder what else is in store for us.

00:56:02.360 --> 00:56:04.120
Anyway, forget about that.
Did you eat?

00:56:04.480 --> 00:56:05.199
I've eaten

00:56:05.200 --> 00:56:05.879
Huh?!

00:56:05.880 --> 00:56:07.439
Why don't you tell them that
you don't need to work the night shift?

00:56:07.440 --> 00:56:08.640
Wait, I'll call you right back!

00:56:45.920 --> 00:56:47.479
- Yes, Father.
- Paari sir.

00:56:47.480 --> 00:56:48.720
Sir, the violin music...

00:56:48.840 --> 00:56:50.440
it's playing near the church again.

00:56:51.560 --> 00:56:53.320
I think he's back, sir.

00:56:53.520 --> 00:56:54.600
Father, don't be afraid!

00:56:54.840 --> 00:56:56.480
There are already two PCs at the church,

00:56:56.600 --> 00:56:57.639
they'll handle it.

00:56:57.640 --> 00:56:58.520
I'm on my way.

00:57:20.760 --> 00:57:21.960
- Hello.
- Hello!

00:57:22.280 --> 00:57:23.319
Tell me, sir.

00:57:23.320 --> 00:57:24.720
How many of you are at the station?

00:57:24.880 --> 00:57:27.599
Sir... it's me and two other PCs.

00:57:27.600 --> 00:57:29.239
Azhagu has gone to get dinner.

00:57:29.240 --> 00:57:30.759
Leave Azhagu at the station,

00:57:30.760 --> 00:57:32.480
and the three of you
leave for the church immediately!

00:57:33.240 --> 00:57:34.200
What happened, sir?

00:57:34.360 --> 00:57:36.000
They heard the violin sound
near the church again!

00:57:36.240 --> 00:57:37.679
The Father just called.

00:57:37.680 --> 00:57:39.000
All three of you, get there now!

00:57:39.200 --> 00:57:40.800
Understood, sir.

00:57:41.640 --> 00:57:43.280
Sir, what happened?

00:57:43.400 --> 00:57:47.280
Sir told us to leave
for the church immediately.

00:57:47.840 --> 00:57:48.560
Sir...

00:57:49.200 --> 00:57:52.520
but what about the police who
were already on duty at the church?

00:58:06.520 --> 00:58:08.760
- It started raining heavily on the way.
- Hmm.

00:58:08.880 --> 00:58:10.359
That's why I'm late.

00:58:10.360 --> 00:58:11.399
- Azhagu.
- Sir?

00:58:11.400 --> 00:58:13.360
We got a call about some
violin music near the church.

00:58:13.600 --> 00:58:15.559
Sir ordered all three of us
to head there immediately.

00:58:15.560 --> 00:58:17.479
You stay here and man the station.
Understood?

00:58:17.480 --> 00:58:18.200
Sir...

00:58:19.160 --> 00:58:20.160
but me, all alone?

00:58:21.160 --> 00:58:22.999
There's no other way, Azhagu.
You'll have to manage.

00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:24.600
I'll be back as soon as I can.
Let's go.

00:59:53.600 --> 00:59:54.400
Sir!

00:59:55.600 --> 00:59:57.800
I don't think the jeep is going to start.

00:59:57.960 --> 01:00:00.000
Get in first! Come on, get in!

01:00:26.920 --> 01:00:28.360
- Hello!
- Sir!

01:00:28.520 --> 01:00:30.279
Sir, it's me Azhagu!

01:00:30.280 --> 01:00:31.159
Tell me, Azhagu.

01:00:31.160 --> 01:00:33.799
Sir! The serial killer...
he's come to our station!

01:00:33.800 --> 01:00:36.000
I'm all alone here, sir.

01:00:36.160 --> 01:00:37.680
Please, you have to do something!

01:00:37.920 --> 01:00:38.920
Don't panic!

01:00:39.240 --> 01:00:41.160
Get straight to the
weapon room and grab a gun.

01:00:41.400 --> 01:00:43.319
If he gets close, don't hesitate... shoot!

01:00:43.320 --> 01:00:44.559
I'll take full responsibility
for whatever happens.

01:00:44.560 --> 01:00:46.680
Yes, sir! I'm on it.

01:02:27.960 --> 01:02:29.520
Hello! What is it, Umayal?

01:02:29.680 --> 01:02:31.359
Paari... Paari!

01:02:31.360 --> 01:02:33.599
I heard the sound
of a violin outside the house.

01:02:33.600 --> 01:02:36.559
I checked, and that psycho killer
is standing right there!

01:02:36.560 --> 01:02:38.279
I'm very scared, Paari.

01:02:38.280 --> 01:02:41.159
Come home right now! Please!

01:02:41.160 --> 01:02:44.439
'Paari sir. The violin music...
it's playing near the church again.'

01:02:44.440 --> 01:02:47.159
'Sir! The serial killer...
he's come to our station!'

01:02:47.160 --> 01:02:49.560
'...and that psycho killer
is standing right there!'

01:02:54.080 --> 01:02:55.720
Paari? Hello! Can you hear me?

01:02:56.000 --> 01:02:58.520
Are you there? Can you hear me?

01:03:02.680 --> 01:03:04.800
Paari? Can you hear... hello?

01:03:13.920 --> 01:03:15.080
Hello?

01:03:34.280 --> 01:03:36.680
It's okay... it's okay.

01:03:40.560 --> 01:03:43.120
It's okay... it's okay.
Don't cry, mummy's here.

01:03:43.520 --> 01:03:45.239
Ju... just stay here for a moment.

01:03:45.240 --> 01:03:46.640
Mummy will be right back.

01:04:59.880 --> 01:05:00.960
Oh Paari!

01:05:01.600 --> 01:05:03.280
Paari... Paari!

01:05:04.200 --> 01:05:04.960
Paari!

01:05:05.960 --> 01:05:06.960
Paari...

01:05:16.240 --> 01:05:17.320
Yes, Azhagu.

01:06:26.560 --> 01:06:27.719
Oh my God!

01:06:27.720 --> 01:06:28.560
Sir...

01:06:30.320 --> 01:06:31.440
That's my Mary, sir...

01:06:34.520 --> 01:06:36.160
My poor children...

01:06:36.680 --> 01:06:37.680
Jessica...

01:06:40.120 --> 01:06:41.440
Oh no, Jessica...

01:06:42.600 --> 01:06:44.240
Oh my dear, Jessica...

01:06:45.360 --> 01:06:46.640
What about Joseph?

01:08:20.680 --> 01:08:22.640
Do you even know what you've done?

01:08:26.360 --> 01:08:29.999
You had a most-wanted criminal, sought by
both the Tamil Nadu and Kerala police,

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:31.720
right in front of you
and you let him slip away!

01:08:33.000 --> 01:08:34.000
Sir...

01:08:34.560 --> 01:08:36.000
With that violin music playing...

01:08:36.240 --> 01:08:38.560
- and the fear of seeing him right there...
- Hey!

01:08:39.240 --> 01:08:40.640
Aren't you ashamed to say that?

01:08:40.920 --> 01:08:42.520
An accused should be
terrified of the police!

01:08:42.840 --> 01:08:44.279
If the police are afraid of the accused,

01:08:44.280 --> 01:08:46.880
then it's time you take off that uniform
and go find some other job!

01:08:48.760 --> 01:08:50.319
What the hell were you doing?

01:08:50.320 --> 01:08:52.360
Someone walked into our station,
committed a murder, and left!

01:08:52.480 --> 01:08:54.240
And you didn't have the guts
to stop him right then and there.

01:08:54.400 --> 01:08:57.360
Now my superiors are breathing down my neck
asking me what the hell I've been doing!

01:08:57.560 --> 01:08:58.839
Sorry, sir.

01:08:58.840 --> 01:09:01.680
Every news station is running headlines
about the Mekkarai station today!

01:09:02.000 --> 01:09:03.360
Breaking news!

01:09:03.640 --> 01:09:06.720
And here you are, hanging your
head and offering a simple 'sorry.'

01:09:07.360 --> 01:09:08.840
What am I supposed to do
with your 'sorry'...

01:09:15.280 --> 01:09:16.280
Get the jeep, now!

01:09:34.560 --> 01:09:35.560
Paari.

01:09:35.880 --> 01:09:38.800
I had to suspend you so that
the issue wouldn't escalate.

01:09:39.000 --> 01:09:42.880
Plus, the Kerala government is
pressing hard on this serial killer case.

01:09:43.320 --> 01:09:47.200
They've requested special permission from
the CM's cell to interrogate you and Azhagu

01:09:48.320 --> 01:09:50.199
It's a good thing you weren't
at the station that day,

01:09:50.200 --> 01:09:51.560
or it would've been a huge problem.

01:09:52.240 --> 01:09:52.920
Sir.

01:09:53.520 --> 01:09:54.960
The murders happening here

01:09:55.640 --> 01:09:58.680
have nothing to do with the psycho killer.

01:10:00.120 --> 01:10:01.440
How can you say that?

01:10:05.520 --> 01:10:08.960
The psycho killer has committed
19 murders so far.

01:10:09.880 --> 01:10:11.320
Every single one follows the same pattern.

01:10:12.280 --> 01:10:15.240
The victims have been killed by having
their throats slit with a violin string.

01:10:15.520 --> 01:10:22.000
But the pattern of these local murders
has absolutely no connection to his.

01:10:22.280 --> 01:10:26.559
Whether the psycho killer did it or not
is for the new Inspector to find out.

01:10:26.560 --> 01:10:27.920
I can't just let it go that easily, sir.

01:10:28.920 --> 01:10:30.600
He has come all the way to my house.

01:10:31.520 --> 01:10:33.560
Stood right there in front of me

01:10:34.080 --> 01:10:37.000
and looked at me with such defiance, like
he was daring me to do something about it.

01:10:38.520 --> 01:10:41.399
I won't rest until I find out
who's behind these murders.

01:10:41.400 --> 01:10:43.160
This case involves two states!

01:10:44.120 --> 01:10:46.960
Don't do anything reckless and
get yourself into even deeper trouble.

01:10:47.440 --> 01:10:49.400
First, just focus on getting back to duty.

01:10:51.080 --> 01:10:52.320
Please, try to talk some sense into him.

01:10:55.600 --> 01:10:57.360
He looks deeply depressed.

01:10:57.880 --> 01:10:59.000
Stay close and watch over him.

01:10:59.240 --> 01:11:00.240
Okay, sir.

01:11:51.800 --> 01:11:53.240
- How much?
- 10 rupees

01:12:04.480 --> 01:12:05.480
Joseph!

01:12:05.800 --> 01:12:06.640
Oh no...

01:12:07.080 --> 01:12:08.080
Joseph...

01:12:08.440 --> 01:12:10.360
Sir, what happened to him?

01:12:28.960 --> 01:12:29.960
Hey, Azhagu!

01:12:30.600 --> 01:12:31.279
Yes, sir.

01:12:31.280 --> 01:12:32.279
It's nothing.

01:12:32.280 --> 01:12:35.159
I was transferred suddenly so it'll take
some time for my family to move here.

01:12:35.160 --> 01:12:36.920
Do you need someone to cook, sir?

01:12:37.400 --> 01:12:38.759
I'll handle that.

01:12:38.760 --> 01:12:40.199
It gets chilly at night, man.

01:12:40.200 --> 01:12:42.200
Even booze isn't doing the trick.

01:12:42.600 --> 01:12:43.999
Can you get me something...
a little company?

01:12:44.000 --> 01:12:44.840
What, sir?!

01:12:45.360 --> 01:12:46.880
Company, man. Some company.

01:12:48.000 --> 01:12:49.559
You can't get that around here, sir.

01:12:49.560 --> 01:12:50.879
And that's not part of my job.

01:12:50.880 --> 01:12:53.400
Hey! What's with that tone?

01:12:53.760 --> 01:12:55.879
You think you're in your hometown
and can act all arrogant?

01:12:55.880 --> 01:12:56.799
Get out!

01:12:56.800 --> 01:12:59.480
Go get me a strong, hot tea.

01:12:59.600 --> 01:13:01.680
That's part of your job too. Get lost!

01:13:02.200 --> 01:13:03.279
Okay, sir.

01:13:03.280 --> 01:13:04.720
Some big shot you are.

01:13:12.760 --> 01:13:14.240
- Sir!
- Huh?

01:13:16.280 --> 01:13:17.239
Who are you, man?

01:13:17.240 --> 01:13:19.199
I've never seen you around here.

01:13:19.200 --> 01:13:20.520
My name is Maideen, sir.

01:13:20.800 --> 01:13:23.480
I used to work with Joseph,
who died two weeks ago.

01:13:24.600 --> 01:13:26.680
I have some suspicions
about his death, sir.

01:13:27.000 --> 01:13:27.679
Hmm?

01:13:27.680 --> 01:13:30.159
I was hoping to see
the Inspector about it...

01:13:30.160 --> 01:13:31.240
Hmm.

01:13:34.880 --> 01:13:36.680
What is it? Tell me.

01:13:36.840 --> 01:13:38.320
Sir, please don't take this the wrong way.

01:13:38.520 --> 01:13:40.239
I need to speak to the Inspector himself.

01:13:40.240 --> 01:13:41.960
Fine, don't tell me.

01:13:42.320 --> 01:13:43.559
But that man is a psycho.

01:13:43.560 --> 01:13:45.680
You won't get anything out of him anyway.

01:13:46.080 --> 01:13:47.080
Do one thing.

01:13:47.280 --> 01:13:48.400
Go see Paari, sir.

01:13:49.240 --> 01:13:50.280
Who is he, sir?

01:13:50.440 --> 01:13:52.719
He was the Inspector
here when Joseph died.

01:13:52.720 --> 01:13:54.440
That's why I'm telling you, go see him.

01:13:54.560 --> 01:13:57.640
If I'd caught that psycho back then,
I wouldn't be trapped with this psycho now

01:13:57.960 --> 01:13:58.960
Okay.

01:14:01.440 --> 01:14:02.319
- Sir.
- Hmm?

01:14:02.320 --> 01:14:03.280
Who is that, sir?

01:14:03.560 --> 01:14:04.879
He's a friend of Joseph's.

01:14:04.880 --> 01:14:07.320
He insisted on seeing Paari, sir.
Said it's something important.

01:14:09.160 --> 01:14:11.160
- That's why I've sent him to his house.
- Okay, sir.

01:14:21.920 --> 01:14:23.360
Joseph...

01:14:38.960 --> 01:14:39.880
Hmm?

01:14:58.440 --> 01:14:59.360
Tell me.

01:14:59.520 --> 01:15:00.800
I need to see Paari, sir.

01:15:01.760 --> 01:15:03.160
He's not home right now.

01:15:03.560 --> 01:15:04.760
When will he be back, madam?

01:15:04.880 --> 01:15:06.719
Hmm... he'll be late.

01:15:06.720 --> 01:15:10.360
I'll just wait off to the side
until he gets here, madam.

01:15:11.920 --> 01:15:12.879
Okay.

01:15:12.880 --> 01:15:13.720
Hmm.

01:15:43.680 --> 01:15:45.199
Why do you want to meet him?

01:15:45.200 --> 01:15:46.560
My name is Maideen, madam.

01:15:46.800 --> 01:15:49.000
I used to work with Joseph.

01:15:49.400 --> 01:15:50.879
I came to town to visit him,

01:15:50.880 --> 01:15:53.000
and that's when I found out
he has passed away.

01:15:53.600 --> 01:15:56.000
I need to speak with sir
about that matter.

01:15:57.560 --> 01:15:59.280
Alright. Please come inside.

01:16:04.320 --> 01:16:05.600
- Please sit down.
- Hmm.

01:16:09.120 --> 01:16:11.600
- Would you like something to drink?
- No, it's alright, thank you, madam.

01:16:11.960 --> 01:16:13.240
It's no trouble at all. Tell me.

01:16:14.080 --> 01:16:15.600
If you don't mind,
could I get some black tea?

01:16:15.960 --> 01:16:16.719
Okay.

01:16:16.720 --> 01:16:17.720
Umayal!

01:16:20.160 --> 01:16:21.280
Tell me, sister.

01:16:22.200 --> 01:16:24.079
He used to work with Joseph, right?

01:16:24.080 --> 01:16:25.639
Yeah... that's what he said.

01:16:25.640 --> 01:16:27.599
Can I have a word with him?

01:16:27.600 --> 01:16:28.760
Sure, come on in.

01:16:37.000 --> 01:16:40.240
After my husband passed away,
our entire family depended on Joseph.

01:16:41.280 --> 01:16:42.200
Please, tell me.

01:16:42.680 --> 01:16:44.440
Did he have any trouble there?

01:16:44.600 --> 01:16:46.320
Did he get into a fight with anyone?

01:16:46.600 --> 01:16:47.840
Nothing like that, sister.

01:16:48.360 --> 01:16:50.240
He never fights with anyone.

01:16:50.640 --> 01:16:52.439
With the money he won in the lottery,

01:16:52.440 --> 01:16:55.480
he just came home to start his
own tea shop and settle down.

01:16:56.680 --> 01:16:58.160
But when I got here...

01:16:58.800 --> 01:16:59.800
What?!

01:17:00.320 --> 01:17:02.600
Joseph won the lottery?

01:17:04.440 --> 01:17:05.960
What did you do to Joseph?

01:17:07.920 --> 01:17:10.360
I came here to ask you
what happened to Joseph,

01:17:10.480 --> 01:17:11.639
but you're questioning me instead.

01:17:11.640 --> 01:17:12.640
Stop acting!

01:17:12.760 --> 01:17:14.639
The night before he left,
he was on the phone with you,

01:17:14.640 --> 01:17:17.119
telling you he had won the lottery
and was coming home to settle down.

01:17:17.120 --> 01:17:18.959
I heard him! I heard it all!
Tell me the truth!

01:17:18.960 --> 01:17:19.999
What did you do to him?

01:17:20.000 --> 01:17:21.599
You did something for
that money, didn't you?

01:17:21.600 --> 01:17:22.759
Are you going to tell me or not?

01:17:22.760 --> 01:17:23.919
I won't let you get away with this!

01:17:23.920 --> 01:17:25.239
You're hiding something!

01:17:25.240 --> 01:17:27.319
You killed him for money
and now you're putting on an act?

01:17:27.320 --> 01:17:28.239
He was my friend!

01:17:28.240 --> 01:17:29.960
He only ever wanted all of you to be well!

01:17:30.320 --> 01:17:31.960
How could you betray him like this?

01:17:47.520 --> 01:17:48.360
Huh?!

01:18:24.520 --> 01:18:25.719
Pick up, Paari!

01:18:25.720 --> 01:18:27.640
Please, Paari!
Pick up... pick up the phone!

01:18:33.160 --> 01:18:33.960
Damn!

01:18:34.920 --> 01:18:35.760
Paari, listen.

01:18:36.000 --> 01:18:38.360
Because the Kerala government
is involved in this case,

01:18:38.480 --> 01:18:40.000
I don't know what I can even do.

01:18:40.320 --> 01:18:42.000
If you have any faith in God,

01:18:42.160 --> 01:18:44.920
pray that I get to wear
that uniform again.

01:18:45.400 --> 01:18:46.360
Okay, sir.

01:19:04.960 --> 01:19:07.400
- Yes, Paari.
- The investigation just ended.

01:19:08.400 --> 01:19:09.880
What happened?
Why all these calls?

01:19:10.240 --> 01:19:11.520
Nothing, Paari.

01:19:12.520 --> 01:19:14.159
I had a bad dream.

01:19:14.160 --> 01:19:15.160
When are you coming?

01:19:15.520 --> 01:19:16.600
I'm leaving now.

01:20:18.400 --> 01:20:27.560
"My dear, the banyan tree
It has fallen, uprooted..."

01:20:28.400 --> 01:20:32.200
"It has fallen..."

01:20:32.640 --> 01:20:49.400
"My lotus that bloomed in the stream,
Why have you vanished from my sight?"

01:20:50.000 --> 01:21:04.280
"Your laughter that once carved
through stone, Has turned into tears..."

01:21:04.880 --> 01:21:19.760
"The memories of you that seep into my soul,
Why do they kill me without ending my life?"

01:21:20.600 --> 01:21:28.480
"Darkness has swallowed my forest
My entire world is engulfed in shadow..."

01:21:28.960 --> 01:21:37.720
"One life has been lost
Our nest is now incomplete..."

01:21:57.120 --> 01:22:02.719
"Did you not hear
the child's screaming cry?"

01:22:02.720 --> 01:22:09.120
"Before you died,
did you not look to God?"

01:22:09.240 --> 01:22:16.840
"My precious light
that I can no longer see..."

01:22:17.440 --> 01:22:24.480
"My beacon that is gone forever..."

01:22:25.240 --> 01:22:45.400
"Go to sleep...
Go to sleep my dear..."

01:22:47.640 --> 01:22:51.200
By the way, why did you go near
the Big House on the day of the incident?

01:22:51.520 --> 01:22:55.000
I was on my way back from the ration shop
when I saw Joseph's friend, Maideen.

01:22:55.360 --> 01:22:57.399
I went to the Big house
only to meet him, sir.

01:22:57.400 --> 01:22:58.799
What did you see there?

01:22:58.800 --> 01:23:01.600
On the way to the Big house,
I heard the sound of a violin.

01:23:01.840 --> 01:23:04.160
As soon as I heard that sound,
I stopped right at the entrance.

01:23:04.560 --> 01:23:06.240
That's when I saw him, sir.

01:23:06.480 --> 01:23:07.760
What did he look like?

01:23:08.200 --> 01:23:09.360
He was quite tall.

01:23:09.600 --> 01:23:11.000
He was wearing a mask.

01:23:11.160 --> 01:23:13.840
Just looking at him
gave me the shivers, sir.

01:23:14.120 --> 01:23:17.199
Well, you and Joseph
weren't on speaking terms.

01:23:17.200 --> 01:23:18.560
What was the problem between you two?

01:23:18.800 --> 01:23:20.879
That's our family matter, sir.

01:23:20.880 --> 01:23:21.640
Huh...

01:23:21.880 --> 01:23:24.160
The whole town knows
about your family's troubles.

01:23:24.400 --> 01:23:26.919
People around you are dying one by one.

01:23:26.920 --> 01:23:28.359
First it was your husband.

01:23:28.360 --> 01:23:29.679
Then your brother- in- law.

01:23:29.680 --> 01:23:30.880
Who knows who's next?

01:23:31.320 --> 01:23:32.680
Mind your words, sir.

01:23:33.600 --> 01:23:35.760
My husband was an Inspector too.

01:23:39.640 --> 01:23:41.160
He was an Inspector.

01:23:41.600 --> 01:23:43.160
But he's not here anymore, is he?

01:23:43.920 --> 01:23:45.880
Whenever I call you to the station,
you must come.

01:23:46.640 --> 01:23:47.520
Get going.

01:24:06.840 --> 01:24:09.000
Everyone puts a ring on a baby.

01:24:09.160 --> 01:24:10.920
Why are you so adamant about
putting a chain on him?

01:24:11.880 --> 01:24:15.520
If it's a ring, it might hurt him
as he grows, right?

01:24:15.640 --> 01:24:18.400
I always want to give him
nothing but happiness.

01:24:18.560 --> 01:24:20.960
That is why I've put the ring on a chain.

01:24:21.360 --> 01:24:22.400
Hmm...

01:24:47.160 --> 01:24:50.880
I have some questions regarding
your wife's death and Maideen's murder.

01:24:51.160 --> 01:24:52.160
Tell me, sir.

01:24:52.280 --> 01:24:53.720
Do you know Maideen?

01:24:54.560 --> 01:24:55.479
No.

01:24:55.480 --> 01:24:56.600
What about your wife?

01:24:56.960 --> 01:24:58.199
She doesn't know either.

01:24:58.200 --> 01:25:00.120
You don't know who Maideen is.

01:25:00.400 --> 01:25:02.600
Your wife didn't know him either.

01:25:02.760 --> 01:25:06.399
And yet, your wife had a stranger
sitting in the middle of your home,

01:25:06.400 --> 01:25:08.680
serving him coffee.

01:25:09.320 --> 01:25:11.880
Maideen's murder and
your wife's suicide...

01:25:12.160 --> 01:25:15.400
there wasn't a single fingerprint
on either of their bodies.

01:25:16.000 --> 01:25:18.199
If someone is committing
murder this cleanly,

01:25:18.200 --> 01:25:20.400
there is no way
he's an ordinary person.

01:25:22.320 --> 01:25:23.639
- Hey, Azhagu!
- Sir?

01:25:23.640 --> 01:25:26.239
Isn't she the one who claimed
she saw the killer in daylight?

01:25:26.240 --> 01:25:26.839
Yes, sir.

01:25:26.840 --> 01:25:28.160
What are you doing here?

01:25:28.440 --> 01:25:29.840
I'm looking after the baby, sir.

01:25:29.960 --> 01:25:32.240
Looking after the baby... or...

01:25:33.800 --> 01:25:35.400
Let's not talk about
unnecessary things, sir.

01:25:36.200 --> 01:25:38.719
She's the one who said
she saw the psycho killer.

01:25:38.720 --> 01:25:40.400
And today, she's right here in your house.

01:25:42.400 --> 01:25:45.520
I have a feeling it's you
I should be suspicious of.

01:25:47.400 --> 01:25:48.999
While you and her were together,

01:25:49.000 --> 01:25:50.559
Maideen entered your house,

01:25:50.560 --> 01:25:52.119
and when you found out
he was with your wife,

01:25:52.120 --> 01:25:54.399
you both teamed up and killed them both

01:25:54.400 --> 01:25:55.959
and now you're both
putting on a show for me?

01:25:55.960 --> 01:25:57.200
- Hey!
- What, hey!

01:26:00.360 --> 01:26:01.440
Mind your words!

01:26:02.960 --> 01:26:04.599
The uniform is the only reason
you're still standing.

01:26:04.600 --> 01:26:05.600
Hey, Azhagu!

01:26:06.000 --> 01:26:08.280
You said that your old Inspector
is a 'good man'.

01:26:08.440 --> 01:26:09.440
He's threatening me?

01:26:10.600 --> 01:26:12.840
Let me find just one piece of evidence...

01:26:13.640 --> 01:26:16.400
I'll crush you like a mosquito in my hand.

01:26:17.760 --> 01:26:19.600
Hey, Azhagu, come on, let's go.

01:26:21.000 --> 01:26:22.440
Take good care of him...

01:26:23.280 --> 01:26:24.360
I meant the child.

01:26:36.640 --> 01:26:37.840
I'll take care of Dhruv.

01:26:38.480 --> 01:26:39.720
You should leave.

01:26:40.440 --> 01:26:41.960
I don't want you to have
any trouble because of me.

01:26:42.520 --> 01:26:46.279
This village has said much worse just
because I'm from the Dasarathan bloodline.

01:26:46.280 --> 01:26:47.520
His words mean nothing.

01:26:47.800 --> 01:26:49.599
This might be new to you.

01:26:49.600 --> 01:26:51.360
For me, this is just a way of life.

01:26:52.360 --> 01:26:54.719
Dhruv has been crying all day
and now he has a fever.

01:26:54.720 --> 01:26:56.200
Please, take him to the hospital.

01:26:58.560 --> 01:27:01.880
The child has a slight lung congestion.

01:27:03.120 --> 01:27:04.480
- Cheraya!
- Sir!

01:27:05.560 --> 01:27:06.439
Tell me, sir.

01:27:06.440 --> 01:27:08.840
- Give the child a PCM injection.
- Okay, sir.

01:27:09.120 --> 01:27:12.320
- Come on, come on. It's nothing.
- Careful.

01:27:27.240 --> 01:27:28.280
Okay, okay.

01:27:28.480 --> 01:27:29.800
It's fine, it's fine.

01:27:38.440 --> 01:27:39.159
Tell me.

01:27:39.160 --> 01:27:40.559
Sir, did you get the news?

01:27:40.560 --> 01:27:43.560
The Kerala police have
encountered the masked psycho.

01:27:44.800 --> 01:27:45.759
That's not all, sir.

01:27:45.760 --> 01:27:47.399
They've closed all the cases here,

01:27:47.400 --> 01:27:48.920
claiming he's the one who
committed all the murders.

01:27:59.400 --> 01:28:03.199
'A life-convict who escaped
from Kerala's Punalur prison,'

01:28:03.200 --> 01:28:05.000
'known as The Masked Psycho Kannaayiram,'

01:28:05.120 --> 01:28:07.159
'has been encountered. And in the
controversy surrounding the encounter,'

01:28:07.160 --> 01:28:09.919
'the police team led by CI Mathew '

01:28:09.920 --> 01:28:13.839
'appeared before the
Human Rights Commission office today.'

01:28:13.840 --> 01:28:17.959
'When masked psycho Kannayiram,
who was caught during a vehicle check,'

01:28:17.960 --> 01:28:21.000
'attempted to attack
the policemen and escape,'

01:28:21.240 --> 01:28:24.279
'the policemen fired
back in self-defense,'

01:28:24.280 --> 01:28:28.280
'resulting in the masked psycho
Kannaayiram dieing on the spot.'

01:28:32.840 --> 01:28:33.520
Sir!

01:28:33.800 --> 01:28:35.880
Sir, I need to see the Inspector
about something important.

01:28:37.120 --> 01:28:37.840
Azhagu!

01:28:38.000 --> 01:28:38.760
Sir.

01:28:39.120 --> 01:28:41.599
- Tell the Inspector that Paari sir is here.
- Okay, sir.

01:28:41.600 --> 01:28:42.919
Sir, I have court duty.

01:28:42.920 --> 01:28:43.879
I'll be back soon.

01:28:43.880 --> 01:28:44.880
Just sit here for a while.

01:28:45.440 --> 01:28:46.240
Please, sir.

01:28:55.680 --> 01:28:58.080
Sir, Paari sir is here to see you.

01:28:58.560 --> 01:28:59.919
Why is he here?

01:28:59.920 --> 01:29:01.160
He'll only spoil my mood.

01:29:01.400 --> 01:29:02.720
Tell him to wait. I'll come.

01:29:03.320 --> 01:29:05.319
- Okay, sir.
- Yes, my dear...

01:29:05.320 --> 01:29:07.080
At what time does your
husband go to work at night?

01:29:09.760 --> 01:29:11.279
- Sir.
- Hmm?

01:29:11.280 --> 01:29:13.000
He wants you to wait for a while.

01:29:14.360 --> 01:29:15.320
Hmm.

01:29:34.560 --> 01:29:37.000
- Sir! Please stop... sir...
- Yes, my dear.

01:29:37.440 --> 01:29:38.400
Happy now?

01:29:39.400 --> 01:29:40.560
I'll call you back later.

01:29:41.800 --> 01:29:43.640
I need to talk to you about
something important.

01:29:49.240 --> 01:29:50.240
What is it?

01:29:50.760 --> 01:29:53.160
Reopen the case of that psycho killer.

01:29:53.320 --> 01:29:55.440
He has absolutely no connection
to the murders that happened here.

01:29:56.360 --> 01:29:59.160
Are you working even
during your suspension?

01:29:59.320 --> 01:30:00.639
On what basis

01:30:00.640 --> 01:30:02.840
are you saying that the psycho killer
has no connection to these murders?

01:30:03.000 --> 01:30:05.560
That dead psycho killer had a wooden leg.

01:30:09.280 --> 01:30:10.400
Look at these photos.

01:30:10.520 --> 01:30:12.640
These are the footprints taken
when he came to the station.

01:30:12.800 --> 01:30:14.000
They are size 11.

01:30:14.440 --> 01:30:18.200
How can both footprints be the same size
if the person has a wooden leg?

01:30:22.480 --> 01:30:24.359
This case cannot be reopened.

01:30:24.360 --> 01:30:25.759
It's not in my hands to do anything.

01:30:25.760 --> 01:30:28.240
Sir! Do you understand
what I am telling you?

01:30:28.480 --> 01:30:30.639
I'm telling you that the murderer
is still roaming free outside.

01:30:30.640 --> 01:30:32.199
Do you understand what I'm saying?

01:30:32.200 --> 01:30:33.520
This case is over!

01:30:33.680 --> 01:30:36.199
If losing your wife
is keeping you up at night,

01:30:36.200 --> 01:30:38.999
just have a drink and
go to sleep, alright?

01:30:39.000 --> 01:30:40.400
Stop driving me crazy.

01:30:43.000 --> 01:30:44.840
Oh, look, a master detective
solving a crime.

01:30:46.080 --> 01:30:48.720
If we reopen this case like you're saying,

01:30:48.880 --> 01:30:52.679
your wife was sitting in the middle of
the house talking to some stranger.

01:30:52.680 --> 01:30:53.400
Why?

01:30:53.760 --> 01:30:54.999
I'll tell you myself.

01:30:55.000 --> 01:30:57.119
There was a connection between
Maideen and your wife.

01:30:57.120 --> 01:30:58.279
Once you found that out,

01:30:58.280 --> 01:31:00.519
you killed them both yourself,

01:31:00.520 --> 01:31:02.639
I'll frame you for everything and claim you
tried to pin the whole mess on the psycho.

01:31:02.640 --> 01:31:04.440
and lock you away.
Are you okay with that?

01:31:04.880 --> 01:31:06.440
Hey! Hey! Hey!

01:31:09.680 --> 01:31:10.360
Hey!

01:31:11.240 --> 01:31:12.799
- Sir, sir!
- Sir, please calm down!

01:31:12.800 --> 01:31:14.919
- Sir, let him go.
- Sir, calm down please.

01:31:14.920 --> 01:31:15.999
Sir.. sir...

01:31:16.000 --> 01:31:17.799
This is a police station, sir.
Please control yourself.

01:31:17.800 --> 01:31:19.279
- Please sir...
- Let go of my hand!

01:31:19.280 --> 01:31:20.160
I said let go!

01:31:21.560 --> 01:31:23.640
You dare touch an officer
while he's on duty?

01:31:24.160 --> 01:31:25.640
I'm not going to let you
get away with this.

01:31:28.480 --> 01:31:29.480
Don't worry, sir.

01:31:29.600 --> 01:31:31.240
I'll ensure everything is handled
without any further issues.

01:31:33.880 --> 01:31:34.720
No, sir.

01:31:34.840 --> 01:31:35.840
I'll handle it.

01:31:36.360 --> 01:31:37.120
Thank you.

01:31:39.280 --> 01:31:40.399
Have a seat, Paari.

01:31:40.400 --> 01:31:41.160
Sit down.

01:31:41.360 --> 01:31:42.120
Okay.

01:31:42.560 --> 01:31:45.239
I've called you here because
we need to discuss a critical case.

01:31:45.240 --> 01:31:45.999
Tell me, sir.

01:31:46.000 --> 01:31:49.359
They said the Kerala police had
'encountered' that masked psycho.

01:31:49.360 --> 01:31:51.159
We thought that case was closed.

01:31:51.160 --> 01:31:53.239
But yesterday,
Inspector Samraj called and said

01:31:53.240 --> 01:31:56.400
someone in a mask tried to
attack him inside his own home.

01:31:59.520 --> 01:32:03.960
You were the one who said the masked psycho
wasn't involved in the Mekkarai case.

01:32:04.320 --> 01:32:07.800
So, I've decided to appoint you
as the inquiry officer for this very case.

01:32:08.640 --> 01:32:09.720
Please take care.

01:32:11.520 --> 01:32:12.520
Thank you, sir.

01:32:52.000 --> 01:32:52.959
- Sir!
- Yes, sir?

01:32:52.960 --> 01:32:55.320
I want all the files on the serial
killer's cases. Every single one.

01:32:55.440 --> 01:32:59.000
Sir... the case was closed...

01:32:59.480 --> 01:33:00.680
I didn't close it.

01:33:00.960 --> 01:33:02.640
Please don't take this the wrong way, sir.

01:33:03.080 --> 01:33:04.799
Ever since you started
working on this case,

01:33:04.800 --> 01:33:08.400
things have gone wrong,
both for this town and for you.

01:33:09.440 --> 01:33:11.200
Please, I beg you, don't reopen it.

01:33:11.480 --> 01:33:12.600
Five murders!

01:33:13.240 --> 01:33:14.960
All following the same pattern, sir.

01:33:15.560 --> 01:33:17.880
With the evidence in our hands,

01:33:18.280 --> 01:33:20.560
how can a policeman sleep
peacefully without solving it?

01:33:21.560 --> 01:33:23.320
I haven't slept in a long time, sir.

01:33:23.840 --> 01:33:25.880
Until I find out whose
footprints those are,

01:33:26.440 --> 01:33:28.239
I'm not letting this case go, sir.

01:33:28.240 --> 01:33:30.159
Sir, without a single clue to go on,

01:33:30.160 --> 01:33:31.479
with just a pair of footprints,

01:33:31.480 --> 01:33:33.200
how on earth do you expect
to identify the accused?

01:33:33.680 --> 01:33:35.999
Forget about identifying the suspect
with the footprints for now.

01:33:36.000 --> 01:33:42.240
Can't we use these same footprints to prove
the killer didn't commit all these murders?

01:33:42.560 --> 01:33:45.240
I'm not in favour of you
taking this case back up.

01:33:45.760 --> 01:33:47.560
Whether you agree or not,

01:33:47.960 --> 01:33:48.999
this is my order!

01:33:49.000 --> 01:33:50.560
You must obey it.

01:33:51.000 --> 01:33:52.399
And this goes for all of you!

01:33:52.400 --> 01:33:55.199
I want those serial killer files
on my table in half an hour.

01:33:55.200 --> 01:33:56.960
- Is that clear?
- Understood, sir.

01:33:57.680 --> 01:33:58.600
Azhagu!

01:34:03.920 --> 01:34:04.840
Sir.

01:34:06.840 --> 01:34:11.080
Tell me exactly what happened the night
that psycho came to the police station.

01:34:29.120 --> 01:34:33.960
A policeman should never
handle a case emotionally.

01:34:35.000 --> 01:34:36.800
That's exactly what
I did in Umayal's case.

01:34:40.080 --> 01:34:42.960
There's something I'm missing here.

01:35:01.120 --> 01:35:02.839
'With all this rain and
the constant chill,'

01:35:02.840 --> 01:35:04.880
'everyone in this village
sticks to black tea, sir.'

01:35:07.960 --> 01:35:09.760
Why are we going to Kerala, sir?

01:35:10.440 --> 01:35:13.520
Last time when I went to Kerala,
three murders happened here.

01:35:13.720 --> 01:35:17.960
He hit the church, the station,
and even my house.

01:35:18.680 --> 01:35:19.640
Could it be...

01:35:20.640 --> 01:35:25.280
that he was just diverting me to keep me
from finding out about Joseph?

01:35:26.120 --> 01:35:27.560
Until I find out what that is,

01:35:28.280 --> 01:35:30.640
this case won't move an inch.

01:35:30.800 --> 01:35:31.760
And there's more.

01:35:32.480 --> 01:35:34.840
When Umayal and Maideen were murdered,

01:35:35.520 --> 01:35:37.440
there was a third person in my house.

01:35:39.720 --> 01:35:43.880
That third person must be
someone both Umayal and I knew.

01:35:44.480 --> 01:35:46.640
We don't know who he is,

01:35:47.400 --> 01:35:49.480
but he clearly knows exactly who we are.

01:36:54.880 --> 01:36:55.840
Azhagu!

01:36:56.680 --> 01:36:57.360
Sir?

01:37:04.960 --> 01:37:07.800
Sir, 40 lakh rupees have been
credited to Joseph's account.

01:37:08.400 --> 01:37:09.720
Check the date.

01:37:10.440 --> 01:37:11.640
The 30th, sir.

01:37:14.000 --> 01:37:15.440
When did Joseph go missing?

01:37:16.680 --> 01:37:17.720
On the 1st, sir.

01:37:21.880 --> 01:37:22.920
Sir...

01:37:26.400 --> 01:37:27.400
Come, let's go.

01:38:40.560 --> 01:38:41.920
- Hey, come on!
- Hey, run!

01:38:50.920 --> 01:38:52.280
Who are they, sir?

01:38:52.840 --> 01:38:55.000
Why are they attacking us?

01:38:59.680 --> 01:39:00.880
It was all for this.

01:39:03.400 --> 01:39:04.920
If I'm right,

01:39:05.880 --> 01:39:10.720
this money is the motive behind
every single murder here.

01:39:12.760 --> 01:39:14.120
What do we do now, sir?

01:39:16.120 --> 01:39:17.520
I'm about to host a feast.

01:39:26.280 --> 01:39:28.280
'14th-day funeral rites'

01:39:35.560 --> 01:39:36.520
Hey!

01:39:37.720 --> 01:39:40.519
Who gave you permission to
beat the drum without my orders, huh?

01:39:40.520 --> 01:39:41.520
Just a minute!

01:39:47.440 --> 01:39:50.599
Son, this town has its own rules.

01:39:50.600 --> 01:39:53.679
Because you refuse to
abide by them and run wild,

01:39:53.680 --> 01:39:55.119
this whole town is now soaked in blood.

01:39:55.120 --> 01:39:55.840
Hmm!

01:40:01.760 --> 01:40:08.600
That psycho killer isn't responsible
for the murders in Mekkarai.

01:40:10.360 --> 01:40:12.680
It was one of you.

01:40:13.960 --> 01:40:16.680
And it was all for the money
Joseph won in Kerala.

01:40:18.400 --> 01:40:20.200
Who's behind these murders...

01:40:23.320 --> 01:40:24.520
we'll find out today!

01:40:36.000 --> 01:40:37.239
Listen up, everyone!

01:40:37.240 --> 01:40:40.959
Nobody leaves this place until
Paari sir finishes his investigation!

01:40:40.960 --> 01:40:42.120
Do you understand?

01:40:46.800 --> 01:40:50.599
"The clan of the wicked shall tremble,
At this whirlwind storm!"

01:40:50.600 --> 01:40:54.239
"Closing the grip on the enemy's throat,
The time has come!"

01:40:54.240 --> 01:40:57.959
"The game of dice that breaks the
enemy's patience, The time has come!"

01:40:57.960 --> 01:41:01.439
"The hands of the brave rise in defiance,
The time has come!"

01:41:01.440 --> 01:41:05.000
"Palpitate in fear, Torture and suffer,
Caught in the web, Like a wildfire!"

01:41:05.120 --> 01:41:08.759
"Burn the enemy, Sever the head,
The time for the sacrifice, Has come!"

01:41:08.760 --> 01:41:12.559
"Shattered fate, Striking like thunder,
The dance of terror, Has begun!"

01:41:12.560 --> 01:41:16.239
"Life ends, Breath departs,
The time for the grave, Has come!"

01:41:16.240 --> 01:41:19.199
"Here comes the tiger!
The fox will tremble!"

01:41:19.200 --> 01:41:23.519
"Here comes the wrath!
The enemy's story... is ending now!"

01:41:23.520 --> 01:41:26.639
"Hold your ground, if you can!
Touch me if you dare!"

01:41:26.640 --> 01:41:31.400
"Your end is sealed!
The enemy's game... is ending now!"

01:41:31.800 --> 01:41:32.800
Yes, Azhagu.

01:41:33.000 --> 01:41:35.080
They're running out
of patience over here, sir.

01:41:35.200 --> 01:41:37.120
You're the only one
who can handle this mess.

01:41:37.240 --> 01:41:38.760
Serve tea to everyone.

01:41:39.080 --> 01:41:39.839
Okay, sir.

01:41:39.840 --> 01:41:40.799
I'm on my way.

01:41:40.800 --> 01:41:44.439
"The arrogance that believes,
None can defeat me!"

01:41:44.440 --> 01:41:48.199
"Will destroy itself.
The fire, the power, rises!"

01:41:48.200 --> 01:41:51.879
"The belief that,
None dare question me!"

01:41:51.880 --> 01:41:55.599
"Leads to the dark path,
Consuming the town!"

01:41:55.600 --> 01:41:58.599
"Here comes the tiger!
The fox will tremble!"

01:41:58.600 --> 01:42:02.999
"Here comes the wrath!
The enemy's story... is ending now!"

01:42:03.000 --> 01:42:04.360
"Stop me if you can!"

01:42:05.200 --> 01:42:09.639
Sir, only Naadukaathan, my father,
Sandhanakili, Mayandi, and Mani brother

01:42:09.640 --> 01:42:11.920
are the ones who drink milk tea.

01:42:12.480 --> 01:42:13.320
Hmm.

01:42:13.680 --> 01:42:15.480
Put all of them under
immediate surveillance.

01:42:16.000 --> 01:42:16.680
Hmm.

01:42:32.760 --> 01:42:33.840
I've started.

01:42:39.800 --> 01:42:40.760
Sir...

01:42:41.120 --> 01:42:43.520
the lights are on
at the village head's house.

01:43:17.240 --> 01:43:18.280
What's that in your hand, sir?

01:43:18.720 --> 01:43:21.480
Sir, please hear me out.

01:43:22.440 --> 01:43:23.160
Hmm.

01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:31.200
It's money, sir.

01:43:36.120 --> 01:43:37.680
How did you get this money, sir?

01:43:39.480 --> 01:43:40.280
Sir...

01:43:41.200 --> 01:43:44.000
I trust it won't come to me
having to drag you to the station.

01:43:48.560 --> 01:43:53.479
I took out a bank loan for
Dharani's wedding expenses, sir.

01:43:53.480 --> 01:43:56.480
It was during that slight delay...

01:43:56.600 --> 01:43:59.680
that I saw Dr. Willey
at the hospital and asked,

01:43:59.840 --> 01:44:04.920
'If you know anyone who could get me a loan
at a low interest rate, could you help?'

01:44:05.640 --> 01:44:07.760
That's where I met Mugilan
for the first time.

01:44:08.080 --> 01:44:10.680
Then, I met Mugilan later at the tea shop.

01:44:11.840 --> 01:44:14.000
I overheard you talking to Dr. Willey.

01:44:14.440 --> 01:44:16.760
I know someone who is lending
money at a low interest rate

01:44:17.080 --> 01:44:18.920
let me know if you need some,
I'll get it for you.

01:44:22.440 --> 01:44:24.280
Hmm. Talk to him and let me know.

01:44:25.360 --> 01:44:26.440
And then what happened?

01:44:26.760 --> 01:44:30.000
The next day, Mugilan called
and said the money was ready.

01:44:30.280 --> 01:44:32.480
He told me to come to the
Red Sand Trail to collect it, sir.

01:44:33.800 --> 01:44:35.760
I asked him, 'Why there?

01:44:36.600 --> 01:44:38.559
The person giving the
money is from Kerala.

01:44:38.560 --> 01:44:40.599
He said he was in a rush
to leave for his hometown,

01:44:40.600 --> 01:44:42.960
so he asked me to meet him
on this route, sir.

01:44:43.240 --> 01:44:45.960
You said the Keralite would come here.

01:44:46.400 --> 01:44:47.960
He's been here the whole time.

01:44:48.840 --> 01:44:50.280
He just left.

01:44:51.280 --> 01:44:53.079
He left the money with me.

01:44:53.080 --> 01:44:53.679
Here.

01:44:53.680 --> 01:44:55.920
Just make sure to pay the interest
to me on time every month.

01:44:56.080 --> 01:44:57.800
Hmm. Okay...

01:44:58.000 --> 01:45:02.640
When you said yesterday that Joseph
might have been killed for the money,

01:45:02.880 --> 01:45:05.840
and that the money
hadn't left Mekkarai yet...

01:45:06.480 --> 01:45:08.080
I got scared, sir.

01:45:08.560 --> 01:45:10.280
I called Mugilan immediately.

01:45:11.240 --> 01:45:12.960
His phone was switched off, sir.

01:45:13.360 --> 01:45:15.359
Then I went directly to his house, sir.

01:45:15.360 --> 01:45:18.640
He wasn't at home, sir.
They said he had gone out for work.

01:45:18.920 --> 01:45:20.640
Looking at all this,

01:45:21.200 --> 01:45:23.400
I got scared that it might
be stolen money, sir.

01:45:24.360 --> 01:45:26.880
I knew the money meant trouble.

01:45:27.400 --> 01:45:29.879
So, I called my friend
Sanjeevan in Kerala.

01:45:29.880 --> 01:45:32.079
I told him to find that man
Mugilan talked about

01:45:32.080 --> 01:45:34.320
and hand this over to him, no matter what.

01:45:35.920 --> 01:45:37.240
Call Sanjeevan.

01:45:39.600 --> 01:45:40.600
- Sir!
- Hmm?

01:45:41.280 --> 01:45:42.560
Turn on the loudspeaker.

01:45:47.280 --> 01:45:49.200
Tell me, Antony.
Has the vehicle left?

01:45:49.760 --> 01:45:51.480
Yes, it has started.

01:45:51.760 --> 01:45:53.760
Alright, Antony.
I'll talk to him and take it.

01:45:55.440 --> 01:45:56.280
Okay, sir.

01:45:56.760 --> 01:45:57.760
You can go.

01:46:12.840 --> 01:46:13.720
Sir.

01:46:14.360 --> 01:46:16.319
After all the trouble we
went through to catch him,

01:46:16.320 --> 01:46:17.960
you just let him go
that easily, sir?

01:46:19.560 --> 01:46:22.200
We could have taken Antony sir to the
station and interrogated him, sir.

01:46:22.640 --> 01:46:23.520
No.

01:46:24.680 --> 01:46:25.560
No, Azhagu.

01:46:26.880 --> 01:46:28.520
There's some truth in
what Antony sir says.

01:46:30.760 --> 01:46:33.120
A policeman wouldn't make
such a careless mistake.

01:46:33.720 --> 01:46:35.559
Could it be that Mugilan
committed the murder

01:46:35.560 --> 01:46:36.880
and took the money
himself, sir?

01:46:37.880 --> 01:46:38.680
No.

01:46:39.280 --> 01:46:42.560
I don't think Mugilan is responsible
for all the murders that happened here.

01:46:42.720 --> 01:46:44.959
That one clue we
had proved useless.

01:46:44.960 --> 01:46:46.960
How are we going to
close this case now, sir?

01:46:47.080 --> 01:46:49.000
Keep our suspects under
constant surveillance.

01:46:49.440 --> 01:46:50.879
We'll wait and see what they do.

01:46:50.880 --> 01:46:52.720
Alright, sir.
I'm leaving.

01:47:00.640 --> 01:47:01.679
'Paari, sir.'

01:47:01.680 --> 01:47:04.399
'Sir, the violin music...
it's playing near the church again.'

01:47:04.400 --> 01:47:07.240
'Sir! The serial killer...
he's come to our station!'

01:47:07.560 --> 01:47:10.839
'Paari, that psycho killer is
standing outside our home!'

01:47:10.840 --> 01:47:12.199
- Hey, Azhagu!
- Sir?

01:47:12.200 --> 01:47:15.079
Isn't she the one who claimed
she saw the killer in daylight?

01:47:15.080 --> 01:47:16.120
Yes, sir.

01:47:17.000 --> 01:47:19.560
Kani is the only one who saw
the psycho in broad daylight.

01:47:20.840 --> 01:47:23.080
Why didn't I question her?

01:47:33.160 --> 01:47:34.600
Please, forgive me.

01:47:56.960 --> 01:47:57.840
Kani!

01:48:01.800 --> 01:48:02.680
Kani!

01:48:03.840 --> 01:48:04.720
Kani!

01:48:10.560 --> 01:48:11.400
Sir!

01:48:11.880 --> 01:48:12.720
- Huh?
- Huh?

01:48:13.160 --> 01:48:13.960
Sir?

01:48:14.880 --> 01:48:15.919
Tell me, sir.

01:48:15.920 --> 01:48:18.399
Sir, can you watch over
Dhruv until morning?

01:48:18.400 --> 01:48:20.280
Why are you asking like that?
Give him to me, sir.

01:48:23.080 --> 01:48:23.840
Sir.

01:48:24.160 --> 01:48:26.319
Leaving the child behind
in the middle of the night...

01:48:26.320 --> 01:48:28.240
...is it something important?

01:48:28.440 --> 01:48:31.440
Sir, I'm starting to suspect that Kani
might be the one behind all these murders.

01:48:33.360 --> 01:48:35.560
How could Kani possibly have
committed all these murders, sir?

01:48:36.280 --> 01:48:38.639
Sir, Kani might not have
committed these murders herself.

01:48:38.640 --> 01:48:40.680
But there's no way she
doesn't know what's going on.

01:48:41.200 --> 01:48:42.559
What makes you say that?

01:48:42.560 --> 01:48:43.240
Sir...

01:48:43.880 --> 01:48:45.999
The church, the police
station, the house,

01:48:46.000 --> 01:48:47.879
the psycho killer only
struck at night.

01:48:47.880 --> 01:48:49.800
Azhagu, the Father, and I
are the witnesses to that.

01:48:50.240 --> 01:48:52.600
But Maideen and Umayal
were murdered in broad daylight.

01:48:53.360 --> 01:48:55.439
If no one else in town
saw this 'psycho killer,'

01:48:55.440 --> 01:48:57.560
how is it possible that Kani
saw him in the middle of the day?

01:48:58.600 --> 01:48:59.439
Sir.

01:48:59.440 --> 01:49:01.600
Except for Aaron and Umayal,

01:49:01.880 --> 01:49:05.920
the only person connected to Jessica,
Joseph, Mary, and Maideen, is Kani.

01:49:06.560 --> 01:49:09.360
Kani never lets Dhruv
out of her sight.

01:49:09.800 --> 01:49:13.080
If she left him alone today
and didn't even lock the door,

01:49:14.520 --> 01:49:16.520
it means she knows
I'm onto her, sir.

01:49:18.120 --> 01:49:19.760
This could just be my
own speculation, sir.

01:49:20.360 --> 01:49:22.280
To know if all this
is true or a lie,

01:49:23.200 --> 01:49:25.399
we need to make
Kani speak.

01:49:25.400 --> 01:49:27.200
That is why I'm going
after her, sir.

01:49:28.720 --> 01:49:29.880
Sir, just a minute.

01:49:31.000 --> 01:49:32.400
I will also come with you, sir.

01:50:59.080 --> 01:51:00.200
Sir!

01:51:17.480 --> 01:51:18.480
It's Mugilan.

01:51:31.680 --> 01:51:33.120
- Hello.
- Brother.

01:51:33.720 --> 01:51:35.959
Look up the records for
everyone leaving town today.

01:51:35.960 --> 01:51:37.680
See if Kani's name is there.

01:51:40.360 --> 01:51:41.280
Sir...

01:51:41.480 --> 01:51:43.840
No one has descended
the hill after 6:00 PM, sir.

01:51:49.160 --> 01:51:50.400
She's not here,

01:51:51.480 --> 01:51:52.960
and she's not there.
Where could she be?

01:51:53.200 --> 01:51:55.919
'Is there any way out of the village
besides the checkpost?'

01:51:55.920 --> 01:51:58.799
'There is one, sir.
The Red Sand Trail.'

01:51:58.800 --> 01:52:00.960
'But nobody uses that
trail anymore, sir.'

01:52:03.160 --> 01:52:04.520
The Red Sand Trail.

01:52:33.880 --> 01:52:35.960
Sir, get down and see
if you can push a little.

01:52:39.960 --> 01:52:41.080
Move it!

01:52:55.360 --> 01:52:58.199
Sir, get Azhagu and bring
the jeep, somehow.

01:52:58.200 --> 01:52:59.880
- I'm going ahead on foot.
- Hmm.

01:53:47.680 --> 01:53:50.799
That game you played
to outsmart fate?

01:53:50.800 --> 01:53:53.320
It's led you to
your downfall!

01:54:34.560 --> 01:54:36.159
Please forgive me, Paari.

01:54:36.160 --> 01:54:37.280
Please forgive me.

01:54:38.560 --> 01:54:40.120
It was a mistake.

01:55:22.840 --> 01:55:23.800
Sir!

01:55:51.840 --> 01:55:52.680
Kani...

01:55:53.320 --> 01:55:54.240
Kani!

01:56:02.480 --> 01:56:05.120
All I ever wanted was
a chance to live, Paari.

01:56:22.880 --> 01:56:24.520
What do we do now, sir?

01:56:31.560 --> 01:56:32.280
Sir.

01:56:33.000 --> 01:56:34.600
I'm heading down
the hill to find Anna.

01:56:34.720 --> 01:56:37.000
Please, take care of
Dhruv until I return.

01:56:38.160 --> 01:56:39.199
Okay, sir.

01:56:39.200 --> 01:56:41.400
Until the festival ends,
no one can know Kani is dead.

01:56:42.720 --> 01:56:44.440
We have to identify
the killer before then.

01:56:45.360 --> 01:56:47.280
Where do we hide this body?

01:56:47.720 --> 01:56:48.520
Sir...

01:56:49.000 --> 01:56:50.600
There's no one at
my place, sir.

01:56:51.280 --> 01:56:52.480
Can we hide it there?

01:56:55.440 --> 01:56:57.400
'On the 30th day,
a grand ceremony'

01:57:24.160 --> 01:57:25.480
Anna...

01:57:27.720 --> 01:57:29.200
She's got her TC and left.

01:57:30.120 --> 01:57:31.360
When did they come and get it, sir?

01:57:32.880 --> 01:57:34.280
On the 19th.

01:57:36.320 --> 01:57:37.880
Do you know who came to collect it?

01:57:38.680 --> 01:57:40.159
Anna's mother.

01:57:40.160 --> 01:57:43.080
And... there was another
man with her.

01:57:43.520 --> 01:57:45.160
Do you remember
what he looked like?

01:57:46.120 --> 01:57:48.200
I didn't get a good
look at him.

01:57:50.560 --> 01:57:52.360
He was also a
policeman like you.

01:57:53.440 --> 01:57:54.600
A policeman?

01:57:55.840 --> 01:57:57.520
Okay, sir.
Thank you.

01:58:19.440 --> 01:58:20.999
- Hello.
- Dharani!

01:58:21.000 --> 01:58:24.840
Can you check who was on leave
at the station on June 19, 2007?

01:58:25.280 --> 01:58:26.520
One minute, sir.

01:58:47.640 --> 01:58:49.440
My father was on leave, sir.

01:58:51.800 --> 01:58:52.720
Sir!

01:58:53.080 --> 01:58:53.960
Hello, sir?

01:58:56.560 --> 01:58:57.840
Okay, Dharani.

01:59:26.160 --> 01:59:27.240
Hello.

01:59:28.400 --> 01:59:29.760
Come in, Azhagu.

01:59:30.160 --> 01:59:30.960
Come inside.

01:59:31.400 --> 01:59:32.480
One minute.

01:59:32.800 --> 01:59:33.600
Hello?

01:59:34.160 --> 01:59:35.520
Hell... hello.

01:59:37.000 --> 01:59:38.480
This damn signal!

01:59:39.960 --> 01:59:42.000
Paari sir asked me to
bring both you and Dhruv.

01:59:42.600 --> 01:59:44.800
But he said he would come
and pick up Dhruv himself.

01:59:47.120 --> 01:59:48.199
Okay.

01:59:48.200 --> 01:59:50.120
Sit down. I'll go put on
a shirt and be right back.

02:00:09.720 --> 02:00:12.120
'We could have taken Antony sir to the
station and interrogated him, sir.'

02:00:12.840 --> 02:00:13.600
'No.'

02:00:14.800 --> 02:00:15.640
'No, Azhagu.'

02:00:17.080 --> 02:00:19.120
'There's some truth in
what Antony sir says.'

02:00:19.320 --> 02:00:21.320
I was afraid that
all the reputation I've built...

02:00:23.480 --> 02:00:26.840
and my daughter's life
would be ruined, sir.

02:00:27.920 --> 02:00:30.120
'A policeman wouldn't make
such a careless mistake.'

02:00:33.000 --> 02:00:35.280
'I didn't get a good
look at him.'

02:00:37.080 --> 02:00:39.160
'He was also a policeman like you.'

02:00:39.920 --> 02:00:42.440
'All I ever wanted was
a chance to live, Paari.'

02:00:43.560 --> 02:00:45.640
'He was also a policeman like you.'

02:00:55.800 --> 02:00:56.719
- Dharani.
- Yes, sir?

02:00:56.720 --> 02:00:57.800
18-06-2007.

02:00:58.280 --> 02:00:59.919
Could you check the logs and
see who was on duty that night?

02:00:59.920 --> 02:01:00.800
Okay, sir.

02:01:16.320 --> 02:01:17.480
Azhagu...

02:01:21.800 --> 02:01:23.000
It was Azhagu, sir.

02:01:34.200 --> 02:01:36.879
'Sir! The serial killer...
he's come to our station!'

02:01:36.880 --> 02:01:39.239
'I'm all alone here, sir.'

02:01:39.240 --> 02:01:41.119
'Please, you have to do something!'

02:01:41.120 --> 02:01:42.399
'Don't panic!'

02:01:42.400 --> 02:01:44.559
'Get straight to the
weapon room and grab a gun.'

02:01:44.560 --> 02:01:46.479
'If he gets close,
don't hesitate... shoot!'

02:01:46.480 --> 02:01:47.799
'I'll take full responsibility
for whatever happens.'

02:01:47.800 --> 02:01:49.400
'Yes, sir! I'm on it.'

02:02:19.480 --> 02:02:20.600
So...

02:02:21.240 --> 02:02:23.600
is the killer right
here with us, sir?

02:02:42.000 --> 02:02:43.679
Yes, tell me, Dharani.

02:02:43.680 --> 02:02:45.160
Dad, is Azhagu there?

02:02:45.800 --> 02:02:46.679
Yes.

02:02:46.680 --> 02:02:49.919
He's here saying Paari sir sent him
to pick up me and the child.

02:02:49.920 --> 02:02:51.920
Dad, listen to me
for a second!

02:02:52.360 --> 02:02:57.520
I think Paari sir suspects Azhagu is
behind all the murders happening here.

02:03:00.400 --> 02:03:01.999
Don't go with him.

02:03:02.000 --> 02:03:03.319
Stay right where you are.

02:03:03.320 --> 02:03:04.959
I'm leaving right now.

02:03:04.960 --> 02:03:06.919
Okay, dear.
I'll handle it.

02:03:06.920 --> 02:03:07.880
Okay.

02:03:27.840 --> 02:03:28.880
Sir.

02:03:31.440 --> 02:03:32.600
Sir!

02:03:34.360 --> 02:03:35.520
Sir!

02:05:06.880 --> 02:05:08.119
Hey, Azhagu!

02:05:08.120 --> 02:05:09.719
Where are you going
at this hour?

02:05:09.720 --> 02:05:11.919
Paari sir's jeep broke down,
so he asked me to come.

02:05:11.920 --> 02:05:13.399
That's why I'm heading
out at this hour.

02:05:13.400 --> 02:05:17.280
But he gave strict orders not to let
any vehicles down the hill.

02:05:17.720 --> 02:05:20.559
Alright, hold on a second.
Let me talk to Paari sir.

02:05:20.560 --> 02:05:21.440
Hmm.

02:05:39.240 --> 02:05:41.400
The call isn't going through.
Go ahead!

02:06:07.000 --> 02:06:08.000
Azhagu!

02:06:11.000 --> 02:06:12.720
Thank God!
You...

02:06:38.160 --> 02:06:41.920
I can't believe it's you... the Satan!

02:06:46.120 --> 02:06:47.840
I'm stunned!

02:06:50.760 --> 02:06:52.000
June 30th.

02:06:55.640 --> 02:06:58.640
That book... it won't
spare you either...

02:07:07.200 --> 02:07:08.320
Oh God...

02:07:39.800 --> 02:07:42.760
'Sir, can you watch over
Dhruv until morning?'

02:09:11.880 --> 02:09:14.999
You don't need to hide behind
that mask anymore,

02:09:15.000 --> 02:09:16.400
Azhagu!

02:09:22.720 --> 02:09:24.679
What did you do to my dad?

02:09:24.680 --> 02:09:25.880
He's dead.

02:09:43.680 --> 02:09:48.720
Go join your father and Aaron
in the place they've gone to.

02:10:15.160 --> 02:10:16.280
Water...

02:10:19.560 --> 02:10:21.839
'Everyone puts a
ring on a baby.'

02:10:21.840 --> 02:10:23.919
'Why are you so adamant about
putting a chain on him?'

02:10:23.920 --> 02:10:27.280
'If it's a ring, it might hurt him
as he grows, right?'

02:10:27.640 --> 02:10:30.400
'I always want to give him
nothing but happiness.'

02:10:30.880 --> 02:10:33.560
'That is why I've put
the ring on a chain.'

02:12:20.920 --> 02:12:21.920
Azhagu...

02:13:02.720 --> 02:13:04.000
Paari sir...

02:13:05.600 --> 02:13:07.200
Sir... sir!

02:13:11.480 --> 02:13:12.400
Sir!

02:13:12.920 --> 02:13:13.880
Sir!

02:16:18.960 --> 02:16:21.240
Apply the sindhoor
a little larger.

02:16:22.720 --> 02:16:24.560
The angel doesn't
stand a chance.

02:16:55.720 --> 02:16:57.600
Apply the sindhoor
a little larger.

02:16:58.600 --> 02:17:00.120
The angel doesn't
stand a chance.

02:17:01.600 --> 02:17:03.320
I will ask Vanamangai!

02:17:04.000 --> 02:17:07.160
Why create such a cold-hearted woman,
and made her stand right before me.

02:17:08.280 --> 02:17:09.480
Three years have passed...

02:17:10.000 --> 02:17:11.840
since I confessed my love to you.

02:17:16.160 --> 02:17:18.679
Apply the sindhoor
a little larger, Kani.

02:17:18.680 --> 02:17:20.800
The angel doesn't
stand a chance.

02:17:23.200 --> 02:17:24.399
Was it really you who called?

02:17:24.400 --> 02:17:26.120
Is that why it's
raining so hard?

02:17:57.840 --> 02:17:59.000
Get up!

02:18:35.760 --> 02:18:39.079
"My God hunts,
a storm unleashed!"

02:18:39.080 --> 02:18:42.279
"Setting fire to grudges
that never ceased!"

02:18:42.280 --> 02:18:45.559
"With a spear in hand,
she guards our land!"

02:18:45.560 --> 02:18:48.399
"As the camphor burns,
the fever climbs, across the sands!"

02:18:48.400 --> 02:18:51.599
"It's Vanamangai!
She's my Huntress so wild!"

02:18:51.600 --> 02:18:54.799
"A mother who saves
the sorrowed child!"

02:18:54.800 --> 02:18:57.999
"A blade that strikes
just dare to touch!"

02:18:58.000 --> 02:19:01.240
"One step inside,
and the enemy's dust!"

02:19:39.600 --> 02:19:42.799
"Wielding her mighty her sword,
she strikes them down!"

02:19:42.800 --> 02:19:45.999
"Like rain from the heavens,
she claims the crown!"

02:19:46.000 --> 02:19:49.199
"When evil rises,
she burns the toll!"

02:19:49.200 --> 02:19:52.319
"Clearing the sins
and the broken soul!"

02:19:52.320 --> 02:19:55.559
"Fierce as a wildfire,
swift as the breeze!"

02:19:55.560 --> 02:19:58.799
"The wicked foxes burn,
brought to their knees!"

02:19:58.800 --> 02:20:02.279
"The form of the Forest Mother,
rising high!"

02:20:02.280 --> 02:20:05.120
"Her Vishwaroopam
making the world cry!"

02:20:18.200 --> 02:20:21.439
"My God hunts,
a storm unleashed!"

02:20:21.440 --> 02:20:24.679
"Setting fire to grudges
that never ceased!"

02:20:24.680 --> 02:20:27.839
"With a spear in hand,
she guards our land!"

02:20:27.840 --> 02:20:30.799
"As the camphor burns,
the heat is grand!"

02:20:30.800 --> 02:20:33.959
"It's Vanamangai!
My Huntress true!"

02:20:33.960 --> 02:20:37.239
"A mother for those
who are born anew!"

02:20:37.240 --> 02:20:40.439
"A blade that strikes
just dare to touch!"

02:20:40.440 --> 02:20:43.880
"One step inside,
and the enemy's dust!"

02:20:45.280 --> 02:20:48.199
"Vanamangai, the Huntress!"

02:20:48.200 --> 02:20:49.959
"She's the ruthless Huntress!"

02:20:49.960 --> 02:20:56.680
"Vanamangai, the Huntress!"

02:21:01.840 --> 02:21:04.479
Azhagu will take good care
of Anna and me.

02:21:04.480 --> 02:21:06.319
We've decided to leave
this town for good.

02:21:06.320 --> 02:21:07.920
You've already made up
your mind, haven't you?

02:21:08.280 --> 02:21:10.000
Then why bring
this garbage to me?

02:21:10.640 --> 02:21:11.639
I get it now.

02:21:11.640 --> 02:21:13.800
Is this why you sent
Anna away to study?

02:21:14.640 --> 02:21:15.880
Have you no shame?

02:21:16.320 --> 02:21:17.320
Disgusting!

02:21:18.360 --> 02:21:20.199
Is it just him,
or is someone else tagging along?

02:21:20.200 --> 02:21:21.000
Hey!

02:21:21.640 --> 02:21:23.520
Azhagu, let him go!

02:21:24.440 --> 02:21:25.960
Let him go, Azhagu!

02:21:47.200 --> 02:21:49.879
Joseph was supposed to
meet me here this morning.

02:21:49.880 --> 02:21:51.199
- but he still hasn't shown up.
- Joseph!

02:21:51.200 --> 02:21:55.359
I heard your voice in the background
when he was boarding the bus.

02:21:55.360 --> 02:21:57.119
Shall we go together?

02:21:57.120 --> 02:21:58.200
Azhagu?

02:22:03.000 --> 02:22:04.599
Take this five lakhs.

02:22:04.600 --> 02:22:06.840
Make sure no one ever
finds out what happened here.

02:22:07.000 --> 02:22:09.879
'A psycho killer from Kerala had
escaped from the Kerala Punaloor prison.'

02:22:09.880 --> 02:22:12.559
'The police suspect he could be
hiding in Mekkarai village.'

02:22:12.560 --> 02:22:14.199
I need you to do
me a small favour.

02:22:14.200 --> 02:22:15.559
What favour?

02:22:15.560 --> 02:22:18.680
'The radio news mentioned that
a psycho killer from Kerala had escaped,'

02:22:19.120 --> 02:22:22.279
'and the description they gave
matched the figure I had seen.'

02:22:22.280 --> 02:22:23.999
Paari sir, this is Mary.

02:22:24.000 --> 02:22:27.639
Jessica left saying she was
going to see Azhagu brother.

02:22:27.640 --> 02:22:28.640
Okay, Mary.

02:22:29.280 --> 02:22:33.640
I will pass on the word that Azhagu was
the last person Jessica saw, to Paari sir.

02:22:36.840 --> 02:22:39.519
'Sir! The serial killer...
he's come to our station!'

02:22:39.520 --> 02:22:43.119
Sir... sir... I'm all alone here
in the station, sir.

02:22:43.120 --> 02:22:44.279
I'm scared, sir.

02:22:44.280 --> 02:22:46.119
I really don't know
what to do, sir!

02:22:46.120 --> 02:22:47.760
I'm really scared, sir.

02:22:48.360 --> 02:22:50.080
I'm really scared, sir.

02:22:54.840 --> 02:22:56.839
I thought Jessica
was the only one you killed.

02:22:56.840 --> 02:22:59.999
But you've been on a spree,
Joseph, Mary... you just keep going.

02:23:00.000 --> 02:23:02.319
If you want me to keep my
mouth shut about all of this,

02:23:02.320 --> 02:23:04.760
you're going to have to pay me
exactly what I'm asking for.

02:23:14.560 --> 02:23:16.239
You've seen something
you shouldn't have.

02:23:16.240 --> 02:23:19.000
Now, it's either you
or this child.

02:23:19.360 --> 02:23:20.720
You decide.

02:23:51.400 --> 02:23:52.559
So... tell me.

02:23:52.560 --> 02:23:56.120
Is the future actually written
in The Dark Heaven book?

02:23:58.360 --> 02:24:00.319
And if Dr. Willey is dead,

02:24:00.320 --> 02:24:02.639
then where did the book go?

02:24:02.640 --> 02:24:04.600
What happened to
the curse on that village?

